\id 1CH  
\h 1 Thusimbu 
\toc1 Thusimbu Khatna 
\toc2 1 Thusimbu 
\toc3 1 Thusimbu 
\mt1 1 CHRONICLES  
\mt2 THUSIMBU KHATNA  
\mt3 1 Chronicles Sung Thu Umdan  
\ip 1 Chronicles lekhabu akon hin Pathen'in Israel te chunga thil agontoh dan muchet ahi. Hiche lekhabua kon hin Pathen chate ihinau photchetna tampi aum'in ahi. 1 Chronicles lekhabu kipatna lang hi, insung khat thingphung banga kisong Adam in akipan in—hiche hin Pathen dinga lhentum insung khat chule thusim hi akimatna aum sohkeijin ahi. Bung phabep, tichu (Bung 10) sunga hin, Saul lengpan vai ahin hom in, adang bung amoh chengsea hin David lengpa in Israel te dinga abolthei sun abolin, chule achainan David thi thudol aum'in ahi. Bung khat apat bung ko sunga hin Pathen tohgon dungjui’a Israel te agam uva ahung kinungle nau thudol aseijin chule David in atoh ding Israel mite alamkaijin Pathen ahou khom un ahi.  
\is1 Lekhabu Jihpa Chule Akijih Kum  
\ip Judah te chondan toh kilhon'in 1 Chronicles hi Ezra Themgao jih ahi, ti akicheh in ahi.  
\ip Hichu 450-400 BC sunga anajih ahi.  
\is1 Lekhabu Hi Koi Henga Chule Itih Phatlai Thusim Ham?  
\ip Israel mipite jouse dinga ana jih ahi. 1 Chronicles hin khanggui thusim akipatna’a pat Babylon aum geiju thudol aseijin ahi. Chule bung som le khat apat achaina chan hi David lengpan lengvai apoh thudol aseijin ahi. David chu ama le ama akingaiton, Pakaijin ama chu Israel chate chunga lenga atundoh mong-mong ahitai ti, ahedoh tan chule ama lenggam chu amite khohsah jal’in akichoi sang lheh jeng tai (14:2).  
\c 1  
\s1 Adam Apat Noah Chapate  
\li1
\v 1 Adam son le achilhah ho Seth, Enosh;  
\v 2 Kenan, Mahalalel, Jared,  
\v 3 Enoch, Methuselah, Lamech,  
\v 4 Chule Noah.  
\li1 Noah chate ho * Shem, Ham chule Japheth.   
\s1 Japheth Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 5 Japheth chilhahho chu Gomer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Meshech, chule Tiras ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 6 Gomer son achilhah ho chu Ashkenaz, Riphath * chule Togarmah ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 7 Javan son achihlhahho chu Elishah, Tarshish, Kittim chule Rodanim ahiuve.   
\s1 Ham Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 8 Ham chapa te chu Cush, Mizraim, *Put chule Canaan ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 9 Cush son achilhah ho chu Seba, Havilah, Sabtah, Raamah, chule Sabteca ahiuve. Raamah chapa teni chu Sheba le Dedan ahi lhon'e.  
\v 10 Cush jong hin Nimrod ahingin, Nimrod hi leiset chunga gal-hang masapenin ahung pang tai.   
\li1
\v 11 Mizraim hin Ludim toh, Anamim toh, Lehabim toh, Naphtuhim toh,  
\v 12 Pathrusim toh, Casluhim toh, Caphtorim toh ahingin, amaho hi Philistine hung kondohna chu ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 13 Canaan chapa tahpen chu Sidon ahin, Sidon chu Sidon mite ahung pen nau bulpi ahung hitai. Canaan in Hit kitipa chu ahingin,  
\v 14 Jebus mite, Amor mite, Girgash mite,  
\v 15 Hivi mite, Ark mite, Sin mite,  
\v 16 Arvad mite, Zemar mite, chule Hamath mite jong ahiuve.   
\s1 Shem Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 17 Shem chapa te chu Elam, Asshur, Aphaxad, Lud, chule Aram ahiuve.  
\li1 Aram chapa te chu\f * \fr 1:17 \ft As in one Hebrew manuscript and some Greek manuscripts (see also Gen 10:23); most Hebrew manuscripts lack \fqa The descendants of Aram were.\f* Uz, Hul, Gether, chule Mash ahiuve.\f * \fr 1:17 \ft As in parallel text at Gen 10:23; Hebrew reads \fqa and Meshech.\f*   
\li1
\v 18 Arphaxad kitipa hin Shelah ahing'e.,  
\li1 Shelah kitipa hin Eber ahing'e.   
\li1
\v 19 Eber hin chapa ni ahingin. Chapa masapa chu amin Peleg akiti (hichu “kikhentel” tina ahi); ijeh-inem itileh ama khang laiya leiset mite chu pao le ham chom-chom’a kikhentel anahi. Asopipa min chu Joktan ahi.   
\li1
\v 20 Joktan hin Almodad, Sheleph, Hazarmaveth, Jerah,  
\v 21 Hadoram, Uzal, Diklah,  
\v 22 Obal,*Abimael, Sheba,  
\v 23 Ophir, Havilah, chule Jobab ahingin ahi. Mi hichengse hi abonchauva Joktan son chilhah jeng ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 24 Shem son achilhah: Arphaxad, Shelah, *  
\v 25 Eber, Peleg, Reu,  
\v 26 Serug, Nahor, Terah,  
\v 27 chule Abram, ama hi khonunga Abraham kitipa chu ahi.   
\s1 Abraham Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 28 Abraham chapa teni chu Isaac le Ishmael ahi lhon'e.  
\v 29 Akhanggui kisim dan’u chu hiti hi ahiye :  
\p Ishmael chapa te chu Nebaioth ( apeng masapen ), Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsam,   
\p
\v 30 Mishma, Dumah, Massa, Hadad, Tema,  
\v 31 Jetur, Naphish, chule Kedemah ahiuve. Hichengse hi Ishmael chapa te ahiuve.   
\b  
\li1
\v 32 Abraham thaikemnu Keturah chapa te chu Zimran, Jokshan, Medan, Midian, Ishbak, chule Shuah ahiuvin ahi.  
\li1 Jokshan chapa teni chu Sheba le Dedan ahi lhon'e.  
\v 33 Midian chapa te chu Ephah, Epher, Hanoch, Abida, chule Eldaah ahiuve. Mi hichengse hi Abraham thaikemnu Keturah son achilhah jeng ahiuvin ahi.   
\s1 Isaac Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 34 Abraham hin Isaac anahingin ahi. Isaac chapa teni chu Esau le Israel* ahi lhon'e.   
\s1 Esau Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 35 Esau chapa te chu Eliphaz, Reuel, Jeush, Jalam, chule Korah ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 36 Eliphaz chapa te chu Teman, Omar, Zepho, Gatam, Kenaz chule Amalek ahiuve. Amalek hi Timna sung peng ahi.   
\li1
\v 37 Reuel son achilhah ho chu Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, chule Mizzah ahiuvin ahi.   
\s1 Edom Mibul Ho  
\li1
\v 38 Seir son achilhah ho chu Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah, Dishon, Ezer, chule Dishan ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 39 Lotan chapa teni chu Hori le Heman ahi lhon'in, chule Lotan sopinu min chu Timna akiti.   
\li1
\v 40 Shobal son achilhah ho chu Alvan, *Manahath, Ebal, Shepho,* chule Onam ahiuve.  
\li1 Zibeon chapa teni chu Aiah le Anah ahi lhon'e.   
\li1
\v 41 Anah chapa chu Dishon ahi.  
\li1 Dishon chapa te chu Hemdan, * Eshban, Ithran, chule Keran ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 42 Ezer chapa te chu Bilhan, Zaavan, chule Akan * ahiuve.  
\p Dishan chapa teni chu Uz le Aran ahi lhon'e.   
\s1 Edom Vaipoho  
\m
\v 43 Israel te chunga mi koima lengvaipoa pang anaum masanga Edom gamsunga lengvaipoa ana pang miho chu leng hichengse hi ahiuve:*  
\li1 Boer chapa Bela ahin, a leng vaipohna khopi min chu Dinhabah akiti.   
\li1
\v 44 Bela athi phat in, ama khel’in Bozrah kho a mi Zerah chapa Jobab chun lengvai anapon ahi.   
\li1
\v 45 Jobab athi kit phat chun, ama khel’in Teman mite gamsunga mi Husham kitipa chun lengvai anapon ahi   
\li1
\v 46 Husham athi phat in, ama khel’in Moab gamsunga midan sepai te kisatpia jou lengpa Bedad chapa Hadad chun, akhopi min Avith kiti mun a kon chun lengvai anapon ahi.   
\li1
\v 47 Hadad athi kit phat chun, Masrekah khoa mi Samlah chun ama khel’in lengvai apotai.   
\li1
\v 48 Samlah athi phat in, ama khel’in luipi dunga cheng Rehoboth khoa mi Shaul kitipa chun lengvai apotan ahi.   
\li1
\v 49 Shaul thi nungin, ama khel’in Acbor chapa Baal-hanan kitipa chun lengvai apon ahi.   
\li1
\v 50 Baal-hanan athi kit phat in ama khel’in Hadad chun akhopi min Pau kiti munna kon chun lengvai anapon ahi. Ajinu min chu Mehetabel ahin, Matred chanu chule Me-zahab tunu anahi.  
\v 51 Chuti chun Hadad athi tan ahi.  
\b  
\li1 Edom gam'a ahung lamkai ho chu Timna, Alvah,* Jetheth,  
\v 52 Oholibamah, Elah, Pinon,  
\v 53 Kenaz, Teman, Mibzar,  
\v 54 Magdiel, chule Iram ahiuve. Mi hichengse hi Edom gam'a phung lamkai jeng ahiuvin ahi.   
\c 2  
\s1 Israel Chilhah ho  
\li1
\v 1 Israel chapa te chu Reuben, Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issachar, Zebulun,  
\v 2 Dan, Joseph, Benjamin, Naphtali, Gad, chule Asher ahiuve.   
\s1 Judah Chilhah ho  
\li1
\v 3 Judah chun Canaan numei nu Bathshua kitinu a kon'in chapa thum ahingin ahi. Amaho min chu Er, Onan, chule Shelah ahiuve. Achapa apeng masapa Er kitipa hi Pakai mitmun agilou behseh jengin ahileh Pakaijin jong amapa chu athat tai.  
\v 4 Judah hin amounu meithainu Tamar chutoh chapa pengkop ni Perez le Zerah chu ahing kit in, hijeh chun Judah hin chapa nga jen aneijin ahi.   
\li1
\v 5 Perez chapa teni chu Hezron le Hamul ahi lhon'e.   
\li1
\v 6 Zerah chapa te chu Zimri, Ethan, Heman, Calcol, chule Darda ahiuvin mi nga alhing uve.   
\li1
\v 7 Carmi ( Zimri son achilhah ) chapa chu Achan ahin, ama hin Pakaiya thet umtah gal thil ana kichom jeh in Israel dinga gimna hin lhut pa chu ahi. \x + \xo 2:7 \xt Joshua 7:1\x*   
\li1
\v 8 Ethan chapa chu Azariah ahi.   
\s1 Judah Tupa Hezron Apat David Chan  
\li1
\v 9 Hezron chapa te chu Jerahmeel, Ram, chule Caleb* ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 10 Ram hin Amminadab ahingin ahi.  
\li1 Amminadab hin Judah te lamkai, Nahshon ahingin ahi.   
\li1
\v 11 Nahshon hin Salmon ahingin ahi.  
\li1 Salmon hin Boaz ahingin ahi.   
\li1
\v 12 Boaz chun Obed ahingin ahi.  
\li1 Obed in Jesse ahingin ahi.   
\li1
\v 13 Jesse chapa apeng masapaen chu Eliab ahin, anina pa Abinadab ahin, athum lhinna pa Shimea ahin,  
\v 14 ali lhinna pa chu Nethanel ahin, Raddai chu nga lhinna ahin,  
\v 15 Ozem chu achapa gup lhinna ahin, chule asagi lhinna chu David ahitai.   
\pm
\v 16 Amaho hin sopi numei ni aneiyun amin lhon jong Zeruiah leh Abigail ahi lhon'e. Zeruiah hin chapa thum ahingin, Abishai, Joab, chule Asahel ahiuve.  
\v 17 Abigail hin Ishmael mi Jether kitipa chutoh akichengin, chule achapa lhon chu Amasa ahi.   
\s1 Hezron Chilhah Adang Ho  
\li1
\v 18 Hezron chapa Caleb jong hin ajinu Azubah kitinu Jerioth khoa minu chutoh chapa phabep ahing lhon'in ahi. Amanu chapa te chu Jesher, Shobab, chule Ardon ahiuvin ahi.  
\v 19 Azubah hi athi nungin Caleb in Ephrathah akichenpi in, chule chapa khat Hur kitipa chu ahing lhon'e  
\v 20 Hur hin Uri ahingin, Uri in Bezalel ahinge.   
\li1
\v 21 Hezron hin akum kum somgup jen alhin nungin, Gilead sopinu Makir chanu chu akichenpin ahileh, chapa khat amin Segub kitipa chu ahing lhon'in ahi.  
\v 22 Segub hin Gilead gamsunga khopi somni le thum chunga lengvaipoa pang Jair kitipa chu ahingin ahi.  
\v 23 (Ahin Geshur le Aram chun Jair ngahmun khopi toh Kenath khopi toh chule akimvel'a kho somgup jen alah tha lhon tai.) Mi hichengse hi Gilead hingpa Makir son achilhah jeng ahiuvin ahi.   
\li1
\v 24 Hezron chu Caleb-ephrathah ngahmun khopia athi nungin ajinu Abijah chun chapa khat Ashhur kitipa chu ahinpeh in ahi (Tekoa hingpa ahi).   
\s1 Hezron Chapa Jerahmeel Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 25 Hezron chapa apeng masapen Jerahmeel chapa te chu apeng masapen Ram ahin, Bunah ahin, Oren ahin, Ozem ahin, chule Ahijah ahiuve.  
\v 26 Jerahmeel kitipa hin ji chom khat jong aneijin, amin chu Atarah akiti. Amanu hin Onam chu ana hinge.   
\li1
\v 27 Jerahmeel chapa masapen Ram chapa te chu Maaz, Jamin, chule Eker ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 28 Onam chapa teni chu Shammai le Jada ahilhon'e. Shammai chapa teni chu Nadab le Abishur ahi lhon'e.   
\li1
\v 29 Abishur le ajinu Abihail chapa teni chu Ahban leh Molid ahi lhon'e.   
\li1
\v 30 Nadab chapa teni chu Seled le Appaim ahi lhon'e. Seled chu cha nei louvin athitan,  
\v 31 ahin Appaim hin chapa khat amin Ishi kitipa chu aneijin ahi. Ishi chapa chu Sheshan ahi. Sheshan chapa chu Ahlai ahi.   
\li1
\v 32 Shammai sopipa Jada chapa teni chu Jether le Jonathan ahi lhon'e. Jether hi chanei louvin athi tan,  
\v 33 hinlah Jonathan hin chapa ni Peleth le Zaza ahinge.  
\li1 Mihem hijat hi Jerahmeel son achilhah ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 34 Sheshan in chapa te aneipon, ahin chanu tampi ahinge. Ama hin Egypt mi pasal khat soh aneijin, amin jong Jarha akiti.  
\v 35 Sheshan in hiche asohpa Jarha kitipa hi achanu khat toh akichen sah in ahileh achanun amapa chutoh chapa khat amin Attai kitipa chu ahing lhon'e.   
\li1
\v 36 Attai hin Nathan ahinge.  
\li1 Nathan in Zabad ahinge.   
\li1
\v 37 Zabad hin Ephlal ahinge.  
\li1 Ephlal chun Obed ahingin ahi.   
\li1
\v 38 Obed hin Jehu ahinge.  
\li1 Jehu hin Azariah ahinge.   
\li1
\v 39 Helez hingpa chu Azariah ahi.  
\li1 Eleasah hingpa chu Helez ahi.   
\li1
\v 40 Sismai hingpa chu Eleasah ahi.  
\li1 Shallum hingpa chu Sismai ahi.   
\li1
\v 41 Jekamiah hingpa chu Shallum ahi.  
\li1 Elishama hingpa chu Jekamiah ahi.   
\s1 Hezron Chapa Caleb Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 42 Jerahmeel sopipa Caleb chapa te lah a Mesha (apeng masapen) chun Ziph ahingin, chule Mareshah hin Hebron ahinge.   
\li1
\v 43 Hebron chapa te chu Korah, Tappuah, Rekem, chule Shema ahiuve.  
\v 44 Shema hin Raham ahingin, Raham hin Jorkeam ahinge. Chule Rekem hin Shammai ana hingin ahi.  
\v 45 Shammai chapa chu Maon ahin, chule Maon chun Beth-zur ahingin ahi.   
\li1
\v 46 Caleb thaikemnu chun Haran, Moza le Gazez ahinge; chule Haran hin Gazez chu ahingin ahi.   
\li1
\v 47 Jahdai chapa te chu Regem, Jotham, Geshan, Pelet, Ephah, chule Shaaph ahiuvin ahi.   
\li1
\v 48 Caleb thaikemnu achom khat Maachah kitinu jong chun Sheber le Tirhanah ahingin ahi.  
\v 49 Amanu ma-ma hin Shaaph (Madmannah pa) chule Sheva (Macbenah le Gibea pa) ana hingin ahi. Caleb hin chanu khat aneijin amin Achsah akiti.   
\li1
\v 50 Mihem hijat hi abonchauva Caleb son achilhah jeng ahiuve.  
\s1 Caleb Chapa Hur Chilhah Ho  
\li1 Caleb jinu Ephrathah chapa masapen Hur chapa te chu Shobal (Kiriath-Jearim tungdohpa) ahin,   
\p
\v 51 Salma (Bethlehem tungdohpa), chule Hareph (Beth-gader tungdohpa) ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 52 Shobal (Kiriath-Jearim tungdohpa) son achilhah ho chu Haroeh sung kon Manahath mi akeh khat jen toh,  
\v 53 chule Kiriath-jearim insung mite Ithir miho ahiuvin, Puth miho ahiuvin, Sumath miho ahiuvin, chule Mishrai miho toh ahiuve; amahoa konna hi Zorah miho le Eshtaol miho hung kondoh ahiuvin ahi.   
\li1
\v 54 Salma chapa te chu Bethlehem miho ahiuvin, Netophath miho ahiuvin , Atroth-beth-joab miho ahiuvin , adang miho chu Manahath miho leh Zor miho akeh khat jen jong ahiuvin,  
\v 55 chule Jabez khoa cheng danthu sun'a pang miho insung mite jong Tirath miho ahiuvin, Shimeath miho hi Sucath miho ahiuve. Recab insung penna Hammath kitipa sung peng ngen ahiuvin, Ken mi jeng ahiuve.   
\c 3  
\s1 David Chilhah Ho  
\m
\v 1 Hebron khopia achen laiya David in ahin achapa te chu hicheng hi ahiuve:  
\b  
\li1 Achapa apeng masapen chu Ammon ahin, apenna nu chu Ahinoam akitin Jezreel kho mi ahi. Achapa ni lhinna pa chu Daniel ahin, Carmel kho numeinu Abigail toh ahin lhon ahi.   
\b  
\li1
\v 2 Athum lhinna pa chu Absalom ahin, anu chu Maacah akitin, Geshur lengpa Talmai chanu ahi.  
\li1 Li lhinna pa chu Adonijah ahin, anu chu Haggith ahi.   
\li1
\v 3 Nga lhinna pa chu Shephatiah akitin, anu chu Abital ahi.  
\li1 Gup lhinna pa chu Ithream ahin, David in ajinu Eglah toh ahin lhon ahiye.   
\m
\v 4 Hebron khopia kum sagi le akeh khat sunga lengvaipoa anapan sungin David chun chapa gup hi ana hingin ahi.  
\b  
\p Chujouvin David chun kum somthum le thum sungin Jerusalem'a lengvai ana pon ahi. \x + \xo 3:4 \xt 2 Samuel 5:4,5; 1 Lgt 2:11; 1 Thusimbu 29:27\x*  
\v 5 Jerusalem khopia achen laiya David in ana hin achapa te chu Shammua, Shobad, Nathan, chule Solomon ahiuve. Amaho penna nu chu Ammiel chanu Bathsheba ahi. \x + \xo 3:5 \xt 2 Samuel 11:3\x*  
\v 6 Chujouvin David in chapa ko ahinbe’in amaho chu: Ibhar, Elishua, Elpelet,  
\v 7 Nogah, Nepheg, Japhia,  
\v 8 Elishama, Eliada chule Eliphelet ahiuve.   
\p
\v 9 Athaikemho toh ahindoh ho tailouvin hichengse hi David chapa te jeng ahiuve. Ama hon sopi numei Tamar kitinu bouseh aneijin ahi.   
\s1 Solomon Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 10 Solomon son achilhah ho chu Rehoboam, Abijah, Asa, Jehoshaphat,  
\v 11 Jehoram, Ahaziah, Joash,  
\v 12 Amaziah, Uzziah, Jotham,  
\v 13 Ahaz, Hezekiah, Manasseh,  
\v 14 Amon, chule Josiah ahiuvin ahi.   
\li1
\v 15 Josiah chapa te chu Johanan (apeng masapen pa) ahin, Jehoiakim (ni lhinna pa) ahin, Zedekiah (thum lhinna pa) ahin, Jehoahaz (li lhinna pa) ahi.   
\li1
\v 16 Jehoiakim son achilhah ho chu achapa Jehoiachin leh asopipa Zedekiah ahi lhon'e.   
\s1 Jehoiachin Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 17 Babylon miten sohchanga ana kaimangu Jehoiachin chapa te chu Shealtiel,  
\v 18 Malkiram, Pedaiah, Shenazzar, Jekamiah, Hoshama, chule Nedabiah ahiuvin ahi.   
\li1
\v 19 Pedaiah chapa teni chu Zerubbabel le Shimei ahi lhon'e.  
\li1 Zerubbabel chapa teni chu Meshullam le Hananiah ahi lhon'in, (Amani sopinu chu Shelomith akiti.)  
\v 20 Aman chapa adang nga jong ahingin, amaho chu Hashubah, Ohel, Berekiah, Hasadiah, chule Jushab-hesed ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 21 Hananiah chapa teni chu Pelatiah le Jeshaiah ahi lhon'e. Jeshaiah chapa chu Rephaiah ahin, Rephaiah chapa Arnan ahi. Arnan chapa Obadiah ahin, Obadiah chapa Shecaniah ahi.   
\li1
\v 22 Shecaniah chilhah chu Shemaiah ahin chule achapa te chu Hattush ahin, Igal ahin, Bariah ahin, Neariah ahin, chule Shaphat pumin mi gup alhing uve.   
\li1
\v 23 Neariah chapa te chu Elioenai ahin, Hizkiah ahin, chule Azrikam pumin mi thum ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 24 Elioenai chapa te chu Hodaviah ahin, Eliashib ahin, Pelaiah ahin, Akkub ahin, Johanan ahin, Delaiah ahin, chule Anani ahin, aboncha uvin mi sagi alhing uve.   
\c 4  
\s1 Judah Chilhah Dang  
\li1
\v 1 Judah chapa te chu Perez, Hezron, Carmi, Hur, chule Shobal ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 2 Shobal chapa Reaiah kitipa hin Jahath ahingin, jahath hin Ahumai le Lahad ahingin ahi. Hichengse hi Zorath mite ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 3 Etam chapa te chu Jezreel, Ishma, Idbash, chule asopinu Hazzelelponi,  
\v 4 Penuel (Gedor hingpa), chule Ezer (Hushah hingpa ahiuve0. Mi hicheng hi Hur khanggui (Ephrathah chapa apeng masapen), Bethleham pu le pate ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 5 Ashur (Tekoa pa) chun ji ni aneijin, amani chu Helah le Naarah ahi lhon'e.  
\v 6 Naarah hin Ahuzzam, Hepher, Temeni, chule Haahashtari ahingin ahi.  
\v 7 Helah chun Zereth, Izhar, Ethnan,  
\v 8 chule Anub pa Koz, Zobedah le Harum chapa Aharhel insung mite chengse chu ahingin ahi.   
\li1
\v 9 Jabez kitipa ji asopite dang-dang sanga agunchu jeh in anun jong ama hi nat chungnunga kahin ahi tin amin Jabez asah in ahi.  
\v 10 Jabez hi Israel Pathen henga ataovin hiti aseiye, “O Pathen, nangin keima phatthei neiboh tei-teijin lang, nei kaile jing jengin lang, chule hahsatna le gentheina jousea kon’in neichom khen jing jengin,” atin ahi. Hichun hiche ataona hi Pathen’in anoppeh tai.   
\li1
\v 11 Kelub (Shuhah sopipa) chun Mehir ana hingin, Mehir chun Eshton ahingin,  
\v 12 Eshton chun Beth-rapha, Paseah, chule Tehinnah ahingin ahi. Tehinnah chun Ir-nahash ahingin ahi. Mihem hichengse hi Recah son achilhah ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 13 Kenaz chapa teni chu Othniel le Seraiah ahi lhon'in ahi. Othniel chapa teni chu Hathath le Meonothai ahi lhon'e.  
\v 14 Meonothai chun Ophrah ahingin, chule Seraiah chun Joab ahingin, amaho hi thingthem bol mi ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 15 Jephunneh chapa Caleb chapa te chu Iru le Elah toh Naam ahiuve; chutengleh Elah chapa chu Kenaz ahi.   
\li1
\v 16 Jehallelel chapa te chu Ziph, Ziphah, Tiria, chule Asarel ahiuvin ahi.   
\li1
\v 17 Ezreah chapa te chu Jether, Mered, Epher, chule Jalon ahiuve. Mereh jinu ho lah a mi khat in Miriam le Shammai toh Ishbah (Eshtemoa pa) ahinpeh in ahi.  
\v 18 Chujongleh Mereh hin Judah numei khat jong akichenpi in, amanun Jered (Gedor pa) ahingin, Heber (Soco pa) ahingin, chule Jekuthiel (Zanoah pa) jong ana hingin ahi. Mered chun Pharaoh chanu Bithia kitinu jong ana kichenpi in, chule amanun jong chapa phabep ahinpeh in ahi.   
\li1
\v 19 Hodiah jinu chu Naham sopinu ahi. Amanu chapa lah a khat chu Keilah khoa Garm mite pa ahin, chule khat pa chu Eshtomoa mi Maacath mite pa ahi.   
\li1
\v 20 Shimon chapa te chu Amnon, Rinnah, Ben-hanan le Tilon ahiuve.  
\p Ishi chilhah chu Zoheth le Ben-Zoheth ahi lhon'e.   
\s1 Judah Chapa Shelah Chilhah Ho  
\p
\v 21 Shelah kitipa hi Judah chapa te ho lah a khat ahi. Shelah son achilhah ho chu Er (Lecah pa) ; Laasah (Mareshah pa); chule Beth-Ashbea kho’a tupatpon khonga pang insung mite toh;  
\v 22 Jokim; Cozeba mipa; le Joash chule Saraph, Jashubi-Lehem le Moab gamsunga vaipoa ana pang ahiuvin ahi. Mi hijat le abonchauva amin nu chu khanglui laipeh a athusim'u kisutna lekhahoa ana kisunlut peh ahitai.  
\v 23 Amaho chengse hi bel denga pang ho, Netaim le Gederah kho’a cheng ahiuve. Hiche a chu amaho hi cheng khom uva lengpa natonga pangji ahiuve.   
\s1 Simeon Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 24 Simeon chapa te chu Jemuel*, Jamin, Jarib, Zohar,* chule Shaul ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 25 Shaul chilhah ho chu Shallum le Mibsam, chule Mishma ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 26 Mishma chilhah ho chu achapa Hammuel, Zaccur, chule Shimei ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 27 Shimei hin chapa som le gup jen ahingin, chule chanu gup ahinge; ahinlah asopi pasal dang vang cha tamnei aum pouvin ahi. Hijeh chun, Simeon insung mite hi Judah insung mite bangin apung thei mong-mong pouve.   
\li1
\v 28 Amaho hi Beersheba, Moladah, Hazar-shaul, \x + \xo 4:28 \xt Joshua 19:2-8\x*  
\v 29 Bilhah, Ezem, Tolad,  
\v 30 Bethuel, Hormah, Ziklag,  
\v 31 Beth-marcoboth, Hazar-susim, Beth-biri, chule Shaaraim dunga jong acheng uve.  
\v 32 David lengvaipoa ahung pan masanga kho hijat hi amaho thuneina noiya um ngen ahiuve. Amaho son achilhah ho chu Etam, Ain, Rimmon, Token, chule Ashan pum'a khopi nga,  
\v 33 chule akimvel dunga akhobah chengse chutoh Baalath mun chan geiyin jong acheng uvin ahi. Hicheng hi amaho chenna mun ahin, chuleh, hiche min chengse ho hi amaho khanggui kisimna lekhabua ana kisunlut ah ahi.   
\li1
\v 34 Simeon son achilhah dang ho chu Meshobab, Jamlech, chule Amaziah chapa Joshah,  
\v 35 Joel le Joshibiah chapa Jehu toh, Seraiah chapa ahin, Asiel chapa ahin,  
\v 36 Elioenai ahin, Jaakobah ahin, Jeshohaiah ahin, Asaiah ahin, Adiel ahin, Jesimiel ahin, Benaiah ahin,  
\v 37 chule Shiphi chapa Ziza ahin, Allon chapa ahin, Jedaiah chapa ahin, Shimri chapa ahin, chule Shemaiah chapa ahi.   
\b  
\p
\v 38 Hiche ho hi phunggui hao Simeon a dinga lamkai phabep min ho chu ahi. A insung hou apungin,  
\v 39 chule amaho hi Gerar gamkai langa akitol uvin, phaicham gam'a niso lam geiyin jong acheuvin, akelngoi hon teu din hamhing um umna ahol uvin ahi.  
\v 40 Hikom'a chun ama hon gam phatah, hamhing thalhinna gam lentah, chule cham lenna le lungmong tah a chenna thei akimu uve.  
\p Hiche gam a ana cheng masa mite chu Ham son achilhah mi phabep anahi uvin ahi.  
\v 41 Hinlah, Simeon insunga ama ama kailhah cheh’a haosa chapa te chu hikom'a hin Judah lengpa Hezekiah leng vaipoh layin ahunglut uvin, hikom'a ana chengte Ham son achilhah phabep ho chule Meun mite ponbuh ho ahin, achennau in ho ahin, amu phah-phah asumang uvin ahi. Hiti hin amaho chu asuhmang phat uvin amaho khel’in ana cheng uvin, tuni gei hin ama hon mun chu alo nalaiyuve. Ijeh-inem itileh hiche gam'a hi akelngoi teu neh ding hamhing pha amu u ahi.  
\v 42 Chuin, Simeon mite lah a mihem ja nga tobang chu Seir molsang geiyin akitol uvin, alamkai diuvin Pelatiah, Neariah, Rephaiah, le Uzziel—abonchauva Ishi chapa te ahiuve.  
\v 43 Amaho hin Amalek mi athimoh a jamdoh chengse jong asumang uvin, chule amaho khel’in tuni geiyin acheng den tauve.   
\c 5  
\s1 Reuben Chilhah  
\p
\v 1 Israel cha amasapen chu Reuben ahi. Ahinlah, aman apa jalou tah a apa thaikemho lah a khat alupkhompi jeh chun a upat hi asopipa Joseph chapa te joh achang uvin. Hiche jeh a chu, Reuben hi khanggui kisimna lekhabua chun apen masah dungjuijin akijih lut tapoi. \x + \xo 5:1 \xt Semtilbu 35:22; 49:3,4\x*  
\v 2 Judah son achilhah te chu athahat pen’a ahung pan uva chule amaho phunga konna leng khat ahung kisepdoh jeng vang'in, upatna kiti hi Joseph bou achangin ahi. \x + \xo 5:2 \xt Semtilbu 49:8-10\x*   
\b  
\li1
\v 3 Israel chapa apeng masapen Reuben chapa te chu Hanoch ahin, Pallu ahin, Hezron ahin, chule Carmi ahi.   
\li1
\v 4 Joel son achilhah ho chu Shemaiah ahin, Gog ahin, Shimei ahin, \x + \xo 5:4 \xt 2 Lengte 15:29\x*  
\v 5 Micah ahin, Reaiah ahin, Baal ahin,  
\v 6 le Beerah ahi. Assyria Lengpa Tiglath-Pileser pa chu Beerah anahi.   
\li1
\v 7 Beerah inkote chu ama phung sunga akhangguiya akisimtoh a akijih toh tengleh alamkai chu Jeriel ahin, Zechariah jong ahi;  
\v 8 chule Azaz chapa Bela ahin, Shema chapa ahin, chule Joel chapa jong ahi.  
\li1 Reuben mite ho hi Aroer apat Nebon chan gei, chule Baal-Meon chan geiya cheng ahiuve.  
\v 9 Chule amaho hin Gilead gam'a chun gancha tamtah anei jeh uva niso lama jong acheng uvin, nelgam jotna lampi langa pat Euphrates luipi gal lam geiyin acheng uvin ahi.   
\li1
\v 10 Sual leng vaipoh laiyin jong Reuben mite hin Hagar mite chunga gal abol uvin ahi, hiche Hagar mite chu ajo phat uvin Gilead niso lama amaho ponbuh jouse a chun alhung keiyin achen den lo tauvin ahi.   
\s1 Gad Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 11 Gad son achilhah ho chu Reuben mite ho toh kigalsaiyin acheng uvin Bashan apat Salecah chan geiyin alouve.  
\v 12 Joel chu Bashan khoa lamkaijin apangin, Shapham khoa lamkai anina in apangin, ama ni ban’a Janai le Shaphat ajong pang ahi lhon'e.   
\li1
\v 13 Amaho insunga phunggui sagi lamkai ho chu Michael ahin, Meshullam ahin, Sheba ahin, Jorai ahin, Jacan ahin, Zia ahin, chule Eber ahi.  
\v 14 Hiche ho chengse hi abonchauva Huri chapa Abihail son achilhah jeng ahiuve; Huri chu Jaroah chapa ahin, Jaroah chu Gilead chapa ahin, Michael chu Jeshishai chapa ahin, Jeshishai chu Jahdo chapa, chule Jahdo chu Buz chapa ahi.  
\v 15 Ahi chu Abdiel chapa ahin, Abdiel chu Guni chapa ahin chule Guni hi amaho insung lhah a lamkai ahi.   
\b  
\p
\v 16 Gad mite hi Gilead gamsung, Bashan gamsung, chule akhobah jouse le Sharon gam hamhing phatna lai jousea acheng uvin ahi.  
\v 17 Mihem hijat khanggui thusim hi Judah lengpa Jotham lallai le Israel lengpa Jeroboam lal laiya kisimtoh a kijih doh ahiye.   
\s1 Jordan Solam'a Phung Ho  
\p
\v 18 Reuben chapa te leh Gad chapa te chule Manaseh phung keh khat jong hin gal-hang mihat, pho le chemjam thoa gal bolthei, thalpi kap them, galsat themtah tah sepai 44,760 jen galbol dia gonsa anei jing uvin ahi.  
\v 19 Amaho hin Hagar mite chung le Jetur mite chung, chule Naphish mite le Nodab mite chunga gal abol uve.  
\v 20 Gallai hin ama hon Pathen hengah panpina athum un, ama hon Pathen tahsanna anei jeh uvin, aman ataonau chu asanpeh tai. Hijeh chun ama hon Hagar mite le amaho panpi chengse chu ajou sohhel tauve.  
\v 21 Ama hon akisatpi Hagar mite thil achompeh ho chu sangongsao 50,000 jen ahin, kelngoi le kelcha 250,000 jen toh ahin, sangan 2,000 chule mihem 100,000 jen gal-hingin akaiyun ahi.  
\v 22 Gal kisat chu Pathen'in apanpi jeh un Hagar mite simsen lou akijam chap jengin ahi. Sohchanga akitolmang kah seuvin amaho gamsunga chun Reuben mite, Gad mite, chu Manaseh mite acheng tauve.   
\p
\v 23 Manasseh phung kehkhat jong mihem atam lheh jeng uvin, Bashan gam'a pat Baal-hermon gei, Senir gei, chule Hermon Molsang geiyin achengdoh peh jeng uvin ahi.  
\v 24 Ama ama pajang lhah a insung cheh uva a upa chengse chu: Epher ahin, Ishi ahin, Eliel ahin, Azriel ahin, Jeremiah ahin, Hodaviah ahin, chule Jahdiel toh ahiuve. Amaho mihat gal-hang ho hina lama minthanna anei uvin, chule ama-ama insung pajang lhah a a upa chengse chu ahitauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Ahivangin amaho hin apu apateu Pathen ahou khel uvin, Pathen'in asuhmangsa mite gam'a vaipo ho pathen limsemthu doi ho akou tauvin ahi.  
\v 26 Hiche jeh hin Pathen'in Assyria lengpa Pul (Tiglath-Piteser jong akiti ) lungthim ahin tildoh peh in, hiche Reuben mite le Gad mite toh, chule Manasseh phung akeh khat hi akaimangin ahi. Assyria ten amaho hi Halah kho le Habor kho, Hara kho, chule Gozan Vadunga ahin kailut uvin, tuni geiyin aumden tauve. \x + \xo 5:26 \xt 2 Lengte 15:19; \xt 2 Lengte 15:29; \xt 2 Lengte 17:6\x*   
\c 6  
\s1 Thempu Te Kailhah  
\p
\v 1 Levi chapa te chu Gershon, Kohath, chule Merari ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 2 Kohath chilhah ho chu Amram, Izhar, Hebron, chule Uzziel ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 3 Amram chate chu Aaron, Moses, chule Miriam ahiuve.  
\li1 Aaron chapa te chu Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar, chule Ithamar ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 4 Eleazer hin Phinehas ana hing'e.  
\li1 Phinehas hin Abishua ana hing'e.   
\li1
\v 5 Abishua hin Bukki ana hing'e.  
\li1 Bukki hin Uzzi ahing'e.   
\li1
\v 6 Uzzi hin Zerahiah ahing'e.  
\li1 Zerahiah in Meraioth ahing'e.   
\li1
\v 7 Meraioth hin Amariah ahing'e.  
\li1 Amariah hin Ahitub ahing'e.   
\li1
\v 8 Ahitub hin Zadok ahing'e.  
\li1 Zadok hin Ahimaaz ahing'e.   
\li1
\v 9 Johanan hin Azariah chu ahing'e.  
\li1 Azariah chun Johanan ahing'e.   
\li1
\v 10 Johanan hin Azariah chu ahingin, ama hi Jerusalem khopia Solomon Hou-In sahdoh sunga Thempu Chungnunga hung pang ahi.   
\li1
\v 11 Azariah hin Amariah ahing'e.  
\li1 Amariah chun Ahitub ahing'e.   
\li1
\v 12 Ahitub hin Zadok ahing'e.  
\li1 Zadok chun Shallum ahing'e.   
\li1
\v 13 Shallum hin Hilkiah ahing'e.  
\li1 Hilkiah chun Azariah ahing'e.   
\li1
\v 14 Azariah hin Seraiah ahing'e.  
\li1 Seraiah chun Jehozadak ahingin,  
\v 15 Pakaijin Judah mite leh Jerusalem mite sohchanga asol manga Nebuchadnezzar khut a atolmang lah ah ajaovin ahi.   
\s1 Levi Mite Phungkhai  
\li1
\v 16 Levi chapa te chu Gershon, Kohath, chule Merari ahiuve. \x + \xo 6:16 \xt Potdohbu 6:16-19\x*   
\li1
\v 17 Gershom chilhah lah a Libni leh Shimei akisimtha lhon'e.   
\li1
\v 18 Kohath chilhah ho lah a Amram, Izhar, Hebron, chule Uzziel akisimtha uve.   
\li1
\v 19 Merari chilhah lah a Mahli le Mushi akisimtha lhon'e.  
\b  
\m Anoiya mi hichengse hi apu apau kailhah cheh ama-ama insung dol cheh a Levi miho insung jeng ahiuve:   
\b  
\li1
\v 20 Gershon insung ahileh, Libni, Jahath, Zimmah,  
\v 21 Joah, Iddo, Zerah, chule Jeatherai ahi.   
\li1
\v 22 Kohath son achilhah ho chu Amminadab, Korah, Assir,  
\v 23 Elkanah, Abiasaph, Assir,  
\v 24 Tahath, Uriel, Uzziah, chule Shaul ahi.   
\li1
\v 25 Elkanah son chilhah ho ahileh, Amasai, Ahimoth,  
\v 26 Elkanah, Zophai, Nahath,  
\v 27 Eliab, Jeroham, Elkanah, le Samuel\f * \fr 6:27 \ft As in some Greek manuscripts (see also 6:33-34); Hebrew lacks \fqa and Samuel.\f*ahi.   
\li1
\v 28 Samuel chapa teni chu apeng masa Joel ahin, chule ni lhinna pa chu Abijah ahi.   
\li1
\v 29 Merari son achilhah ho chu Mahli, Libni, Shimei, Uzzah,  
\v 30 Shimea, Haggiah, le Asaiah.   
\s1 Hou-In'a Tumging Themho  
\m
\v 31 Pakai Hou-In sunga Pathen Thingkhong ahung kitollut nunga David in Hou-In sunga la lamkaiya pang dia anganse miho chu hicheng hi ahiuve.  
\v 32 Jerusalem khopia Solomon'in Pakai Hou-In asah doh masangsen la lamkaiya pang ho hi mipi kikhopna ponbuh a la lamkaiyin ana pang uvin lhacha na atong jing uve. Hitobang hin ama hon atoh ding dol kinse chu hoikei chan atong jing jeng uve.  
\v 33 Hichea la lamkaiya pang ho hi achapa teu toh tongkhom ho ahiuve:  
\b  
\li1 Heman tumging thempa chu Kohath chilhah miho lah a Joel chapa ahin, Joel chu Samuel chapa ahin,  
\v 34 Samuel chu Elkanah chapa ahin, Elkanah chu Jeroham chapa ahin, Jeroham chu Eliel chapa ahin, Eliel chu Toah chapa ahin,  
\v 35 Toah chu Zuph chapa ahin, Zuph chu Elkanah chapa ahin, Elkanah chu Mahath chapa ahin, Mahath chu Amasai chapa ahi.  
\v 36 Amasai chu Elkanah chapa ahin, Elkanah chu Joel chapa ahi, Joel chu Azariah chapa ahin, Azariah chu Zephaniah chapa ahi.  
\v 37 Zephaniah chu Tahath chapa ahin, Tahath chu Assir chapa ahin, Assir chu Abiasaph chapa ahin, Abiasaph chu Korah chapa ahi.  
\v 38 Korah chu Izhar chapa ahin, Izhar chu Kohath chapa ahin, Kohath chu Levi chapa ahin, chule Levi chu Israel chapa ahi.   
\li1
\v 39 Heman’in manchah phapenna anei masatpa Gershon chilhah miho lah a Asaph kitipa chu Berekiah chapa ahin, Berekiah chu Shimea chapa ahin,  
\v 40 Shimea hi Michael chapa ahin, Michael chu Baaseiah chapa ahin, Baaseiah chu Malkijah chapa ahin,  
\v 41 Malkijah chu Ethni chapa ahi; Ethni chu Zerah chapa ahin, Zerah chu Adaiah chapa ahin,  
\v 42 Adaiah chu Ethan chapa ahin, Ethan chu Zimmah chapa ahin, Zimmah chu Shimei chapa ahin,  
\v 43 Shimei chu Jahath chapa ahin; Jahath chu Gershon chapa ahin, Gershon chu Levi chapa ahi.   
\li1
\v 44 Heman in manchah phapenna anei ani channa pa Merari phung'a Ethan chu ahi. Ethan chu Kishi chapa ahin, Kishi chu Abdi chapa ahin, Abdi chu Malluch chapa ahin,  
\v 45 Malluch chu Hashabiah chapa ahin, Hashabiah chu Amaziah chapa ahin, Amaziah chu Hilkiah chapa ahin,  
\v 46 Hilkiah chu Amzi chapa ahin, Amzi chu Bani chapa ahin, Bani chu Shemer chapa ahin,  
\v 47 Shemer chu Mahli chapa ahin, Mahli chu Mushi chapa ahin, Mushi chu Merari chapa ahin, chule Merari chu Levi chapa ahiye.   
\b  
\m
\v 48 Amaho sopite Levi phung sung mite jouse chu abonchauvin Pathen Hou-In Houbuh sunga natong kinbol din akipansah sohkei uvin ahi.   
\s1 Aaron Chilhah  
\m
\v 49 Aaron le chilhah ho bouseh chu thempu kin bol'in apang uvin ahi. Ama hon pumgo thilto kigona maicham chung le gimnaitui kihalvamna maicham chunga thilto ding jouse tohdoh in apang uvin, Mun Theng Pen a natohna ding thil toh din apang uve. Amahon Pathen lhachapa Mose thupeh dungyuiyin Israel te kithoina kinbol’in apang jiuve.   
\b  
\li1
\v 50 Aaron chilhah ho chu Eleazar, Phinehas, Abishua,  
\v 51 Bukki, Uzzi, Zerahiah,  
\v 52 Meraioth, Amariah, Ahitub,  
\v 53 Zadok, le Ahimaaz ahiuve.   
\s1 Levi Te Gamhop Ho  
\m
\v 54 Hichengse hi amaho gamgi hop sunga achenna mun chengseu chu ahiye: Aaron chapa te Kohath phung sung mite dinga phun kisan chu aphat jeh in,  
\v 55 Mihon amaho chu Judah gamsunga Hebron khopi le akimvel gam se-se toh chule avel’a hamhing gam gancha vahna ding jouse chutoh apeh tha tauve,  
\v 56 amavang akhopi loujao lah chengse leh akhoneo dung jouse chu Caleb kitipa Jephunneh chapa chu apetauve.  
\v 57 Aaron chapa dinga khopi anapeh u chule ahamhing gamsunga cheh toh anakipeh tha ho chu: Hebron khopi (kiselna khopi), Libnah khopi, Jattir khopi, Eshtemoa khopi,  
\v 58 Holon khopi, Debir khopi,  
\v 59 Ain khopi, Juttah khopi, chule Beth-shemesh khopi toh hichengse hi ahi.  
\v 60 Chuleh Benjamin phunga konna Gibeon, Geba, Alemeth, chule Anathoth ahin akhopi le ahamhing gamsungse toh kipehtha cheh ahiuve. Aaron chapa te chan jat khopi chu abonchan khopi som le thum ahi.  
\v 61 Kohath chapa te amoh chengse dinga phum aphatna dungjuijin, Manasseh phung keh khat a kon chun khopi som khat jen akipen ahi.   
\p
\v 62 Gershon chapa te chu phun kisan aphat dungjuijin, Issachar, Asher, Naphtali, chule Jordan solam’a um Bashan gam'a Manasseh phung, Jordan solam'a konna kidong khom khopi agomin khopi som le thum achang uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 63 Merari chapa te jong phun kisan aphat dungjuijin, Reuben, Gad, chule Zebulun gam'a kon kidong khom khopi som le ni achang uvin ahiye.   
\p
\v 64 Hitobang hin Israel chaten Levi te chu khopi chujat chutoh ahamhing gam se-se toh ana peuvin ahiye.  
\v 65 Hitobang hin phun phatna dungjuijin, Judah, Simeon, chule Benjamin phunga kon'in achunga kisei khopi ho hi ana peuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 66 Kohath chapa te insung mi phabep jong Ephraim phunga kon'in agamsung uva khopi phabep le ahamhing gam cheh achang uvin,  
\v 67 hiche khopi ho chu: Shechem (kiselna khopi Ephraim thinglhang gam'a um) ahin, Gezer,  
\v 68 Jokmeam, Beth-horon,  
\v 69 Aijalon, chule Gath-rimmon khopi chengse hi ahi.  
\v 70 Kohath chapa te amoh chengse kipe khopi ho chu Manasseh phung keh khat a kon'in jong Aner le Bileam khopi cheh leh ahamhing gam cheh toh ahi.   
\p
\v 71 Gershon insung mite kipe khopi ho chu Golan (Bashan gamsunga) khopi le ahamhing gamsung se-se, chule Manasseh phung keh khat a konna Ashtaroth khopi le ahamhing gamsung se-se ahiye.  
\v 72 Isssachar phunga konna kipedoh khopi ho chu Kedesh, Deberath,  
\v 73 Ramoth, le Anem khopi le ahamhing gam se-se ahi.  
\v 74 Asher phunga konna kipedoh khopi ho chu Mashal, Abdon,  
\v 75 Hukok, chule Rehob khopi le ahamhing gamsung se-se ahi.  
\v 76 Naphtali phung sunga konna kipedoh khopi ho chu, Galilee gamsunga Kedesh, Hammon, chule Kiriathaim khopi le ahamhing gamsung se-se ahi.   
\p
\v 77 Merari chate amoh chengse chu Zebulun phunga kon'in Jokneam, Kartah, Rimmon, chule Tabor khopi le ahamhing gamsung cheh akipen ahi.  
\v 78 Reuben phung sunga konna kipe khopi ho chu Jordan vadung gal lang Jericho khopi dunga, Jordan kal niso lam’a Bezer khopi (neldi gam khopi), Jahaz,  
\v 79 Kedermoth khopi le Mephaath khopi le ahamhing gamsung se-se toh akipen ahi.  
\v 80 Chutengleh Gad phunga konna kipedoh khopi ho chu Gilead gamsunga Ramoth,  
\v 81 Heshbon, chule Jazer khopi le ahamhing gam cheh toh ahi.   
\c 7  
\s1 Issachar Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 1 Issachar chapa li ho chu Tol'a, Puah, Jashub, chule Shimron ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 2 Tol'a chapa te chu Uzzi, Rephaiah, Jeriel, Jahmai, Ibsam, le Shemuel ahiuve. Amaho hi apau Tol'a insung kon mite lah a upa cheh ahiuve. Daniel lal laiyin amaho hi gal-hang mihat jeng ahiuvin, sepai 22,600 alhing uvin ahi.   
\li1
\v 3 Uzzi chapa chu Izrahiah ahi. Izrahiah chapa te chu Michael, Obadiah, Joel, chule Isshiah ahiuve. Amaho mi nga hi aphung sung uva lamkai cheh in apang uve.  
\v 4 Amaho hin numei ji tampi le chapa tamtah anei uvin, hijeh chun amaho chapa te sunga galsat thei sepai hi agomin mi 36,000 alhing uve.   
\m
\v 5 Issachar insung mite mong-mong jong gal-hang mihat jeng jong abonchauvin 87,000 alhing uvin ahi. Amaho cheng chu akhanggui lekhabu uva kijih lut ahitai.   
\s1 Benjamin Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 6 Benjamin chapa thum ho chu Bela, Beker chule Jediael ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 7 Bela chapa nga ho chu Ezbon, Uzzi, Uzziel, Jerimoth, chule Iri ahiuvin ahi. Amaho hi amau insung apu apau lhah a phung upa cheh ahiuve. Chujongleh akhangguiyu kisimna akisut dol chun gal-hang sepai agomin 22,034 alhinguve.   
\li1
\v 8 Beker chapa te chu Zemirah, Joash, Eliezer, Elioenai, Omri, Jeremoth, Abijah, Anathoth, chule Alemeth toh ahiuve.  
\v 9 Amaho hi apu apateu lhah a insung upa cheh ahiuve. Amaho hi akhangguiya lekhabua kisut lut dungjuijin mihat gal-hang se-se le lamkai se-se chu agomin mihem 20,200 alhing uvin ahi.   
\li1
\v 10 Jediael chapa chu Bilhan ahi. Bilhan chapa te chu Jeush, Benjamin, Ehud, Kenaanah, Zethan, Tarshish, chule Ahishahar ahiuve.  
\v 11 Amaho cheng hi apu apateu insunga phung upa cheh ahiuve. Hichengse phung sunga hin gal-hang mihat galbol thei cheh agomin 17,200 alhing uve.   
\li1
\v 12 Ir chapa teni chu Shuppim le Huppim ahi lhon'e. Hushim chu apa Aher ahi.   
\s1 Naphtali Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 13 Naphtali chapa te chu Jahzeel, Guni, Jezer, chule Shillem ahiuve. Amaho chengse hi Jacob thaikemnu Bilhah chilhah jeng ahiuve.   
\s1 Manasseh Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 14 Manasseh chilhah ho lah a Aram numei athaikemnu toh ahin chu Asriel ahi. Amanu hin Gilead hingpa Makir jong ahinge.  
\v 15 Makir hin Huppim le Shuppim jong ji apuipeh cheh’e. Makir hin sopi numei khat aneijin amin chu Macaah akiti. A chilhah ho lah a khat chu Zelophehad ahin, amapa hin chanu jeng bou ahingin ahi.   
\li1
\v 16 Makir jinu Macaah chun chapa khat ahingin amin jong Peresh asah e; chule asopipa min chu Sheresh ahi. Peresh chapa teni chu Ulam le Rakem ahi lhon'e.  
\v 17 Ulam chapa chu Bedan ahi. Hichengse hi Manasseh chapa Makir son chilhah ho lah a Gilead insung mite jeng ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 18 Makir sopinu Hammoleketh kitinu chun Ishod, Abiezer, chule Mahlah ahingin ahi.   
\li1
\v 19 Shemida chapa te chu Ahian, Shechen, Likhi, chule Aniam ahiuvin ahi.   
\s1 Ephraim Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 20 Ephraim son chilhah ho chu Shuthelah, Bered, Tahath, Eleadah, Tahath,  
\v 21 Zabad, Shuthelah, Ezer, le Elead ahiuve. Amani hi Gath kimvella cheng loulhou mihon ana that tauvin ahi: ijeh-inem itileh amani hi aganchau guhpeh dinga hung konsuh jeng ahi lhon'e.  
\v 22 Apau Ephraim chun nikho phabep sungin amaho pul adou jengin, alhem lungmong din asopite jong ahung uvin ahi.  
\v 23 Chujouvin Ephraim hin ajinu aluppi kit in ahileh amanu ahung gaiyin chapa khat ahing kit e. A insunga chutobang vangsetna alhun jeh in Ephraim in achapa apengthahpa chu Beriah akisah in ahi.  
\v 24 Aman chanu khat ahingin amin jong Sheerah akitin ahi. Amanu hin Beth-horon chungnung le anoinung chu ana sadoh in chule Uzzer-Sheerah jong ana sadoh e.   
\li1
\v 25 Ephraim son chilhah ho chu Rephah, Resheph, Telah, Tahan,  
\v 26 Ladan, Ammihud, Elishama,  
\v 27 Nun, chule Joshua ahiye.   
\b  
\p
\v 28 Ephraim son chilhah hon gam alouva achenphana mun’u chu Bethel khopi le lhanglam'a kholen dom jouse toh, niso lama Naaran, nilhum lama Gezer le akholen jouse jong ahithan, chule Shechem khopi le akho len-len ho jong ahin, Ayyah khopi le akho len jouse chan gei jong ahithai.  
\v 29 Chutengleh Manasseh mite gamgi dunga hung kilhah ahipeh in, Beth-shan, Taanach, Megiddo le Dork ho leh le akho len dom jouse toh ahitha cheh e. Khopi hijat sunga hi Israel chapa Joseph son chilhah chengse ana cheng ahiuve.   
\s1 Asher Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 30 Asher chapa te chu Imnah, Ishvah, Ishvi, chule Beriah ahiuve. Ama hon sopi numei khat aneiyuvin amin Serah ahi.   
\li1
\v 31 Beriah chapa teni chu Heber le Malkiel ahi (Malkiel hi Birzaith pa ahiye).   
\li1
\v 32 Heber chapa te chu Japhlet, Shomer, chule Hotham ahiuve. Amaho hin sopi numei khat bou aneiyuvin amin Shua akiti.   
\li1
\v 33 Japhlet chapa te hi Pasach, Bimhal, chule Ashvath ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 34 Shomer chapa te chu Ahi, Rohgah, Hubbah, chule Ram ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 35 Asopipa Helem chapa te chu Zophah, Imma, Shelesh, chule Amal ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 36 Zophah chapa te chu Suah, Harnepher, Shual, Beri, Imrah,  
\v 37 Bezer, Hod, Shamma, Shilshah, Ithran, chule Beera ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 38 Jether chapa te chu Jephunneh, Pispah, le Ara ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 39 Ulla chapa te chu Arah, Hanniel, chule Rizia ahiuve.   
\m
\v 40 Asher son achilhah mi hichengse hi, aphungkhai cheh a phung upa jeng ahiuve. Mihat gal-hang mi jeng leh milen milal jeng ahiuve, ti phatea photchetsa cheh ahi tauve. Akhanggui lekhabua galsat a manthei cheh mihing kisimdoh chengse chu 26,000 alhing uvin ahi.   
\c 8  
\s1 Benjamin Chilhah Ho  
\li1
\v 1 Benjamin chapa apeng masapen chu Bela ahin, ni lhinna pa chu Ashbel ahin, thum lhinna pa chu Aharah ahin,  
\v 2 li lhinna pa chu Nohah ahin, chule a nga lhinna pa chu Rapha ahi.   
\li1
\v 3 Bela chapa te chu Addar, Gera, Abihud,\f * \fr 8:3 \ft Possibly \fqa Gera the father of Ehud; \ft compare 8:6.\f*  
\v 4 Abishua, Naaman, Ahoah,  
\v 5 Gera, Shephuphan, chule Huram ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 6 Ehud chapa te, Geba a cheng mite dinga a insung cheh uva lamkai ho chu, abonchauvin Manahath gamsunga sohchang din akaimang tauve.  
\v 7 Ehud chapa te chu Naaman, Ahijah, chule Gera toh ahiuve. Gera hi sohchanga apuimang’u ahin, ama hin Uzza le Abihud ahingin ahi.   
\li1
\v 8 Shaharaim hin aji teni Hushim le Baara ada nungin jong Moab gamsunga cha tampi anei nalaiyin ahi.  
\v 9 Ajinu Hodesh kiti nu chutoh chapa Jobab, Zibia, Mesha, Malcam,  
\v 10 Jeuz, Sakia, le Mirmah ahing lhon'in ahi. Hichengse hi amapa chapa te ahiuvin, a insung cheh uva lamkai cheh ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 11 Aman ajinu Hushim toh jong chapa ni Abitub leh Elpaal ahing lhon'in ahi.  
\v 12 Elpaal chapa te chu Eber, Misham, Shemed (Shemed hin Ono khopi le Lod khopi toh chule avel'a kho ho ana sa'n),  
\v 13 Beriah, chule Shema ahiuve. Amaho hi Aijalon khopia cheng insung phung upa cheh ahiuvin, chule Gath a cheng ho toh kisat a nomanga pang ho chu ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 14 Ahio, Shashak, Jeremoth,  
\v 15 Zebadiah, Arad, Eder,  
\v 16 Michael, Ishpah, leh Joha amaho hi Beriah chapa te jeng ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 17 Zebadiah, Meshullam, Hizki, Heber,  
\v 18 Ishmerai, Izliah, leh Jobab, amaho chengse hi Elpaal chapa te jeng ahiuvin ahi.   
\li1
\v 19 Jakim, Zicri, Zabdi,  
\v 20 Elienai, Zillethai, Eliel,  
\v 21 Adaiah, Beraiah, leh Shimrath amaho hi Shimei chapa te ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 22 Ishpan, Eber, Eliel,  
\v 23 Abdon, Zicri, Hanan,  
\v 24 Hananiah, Elam, Anthothijah,  
\v 25 Iphdeiah, chule Penuel hichengse hi Shashak chapa te jeng ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 26 Shamsherai, Shehariah, Athaliah,  
\v 27 Jaareshiah, Elijah, chule Zicri hichengse hi Jeroham chapa te ahiuvin ahi.   
\li1
\v 28 Mihem hijat hi akhangguiyu lekhabua kisut dungjuijin ama-ama insunga phung upa cheh ahiuvin, chule amaho hi Jerusalem khopia ana cheng uvin ahiye.   
\s1 Saul Insung  
\li1
\v 29 Gibeon pa Jeiel chu Gibeon khopia ana chengin ahi. Ajinu min chu Maacah ahin,  
\v 30 chule achapa apeng masapen chu Abdon akitin ahi. Jeiel chapa te adang ho chu Zur, Kish, Baal, Ner, Nadab,  
\v 31 Gedor, Ahio, Zechariah,  
\v 32 chule Shimeam hingpa Mikloth ahiuve. Amaho chengse hi a inkoteu toh kigalsai cheh in Jerusalem khopia chun ana cheng uvin ahi.   
\li1
\v 33 Ner chun Kish ahingin,  
\li1 Kish chun Saul ahingin, Saul’in Jonathan, Malkishua, Abinadab, chule Esh-baal ahinge.   
\li1
\v 34 Jonathan’in Merib-baal ahingin,  
\li1 Merib-baal in Micah ahinge.   
\li1
\v 35 Micah chapa te chu Pithon, Melech, Tahrea, chule Ahaz ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 36 Ahaz chun Jadah ahingin,  
\li1 Jadah chun Alemeth, Azmaveth, chule Zimri ahinge.  
\li1 Zimri hin Moza ahinge.   
\li1
\v 37 Moza chu Binea pa ahin,  
\li1 Binea chu Rephaiah pa ahin,  
\li1 Raphaiah chu Eleasah pa ahin, chule Eleasah chu Azel pa ahi.   
\li1
\v 38 Azel hin chapa gup aneijin, amaho chu: Azrikam, Bokeru, Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadiah, chule Hanan ahiuve. Amaho chengse hi Azel chapa te jeng ahiuvin ahi.   
\li1
\v 39 Azel sopipa Eshek chun chapa thum ahingin ahi: Apeng masapen chu Ulam ahin, ani lhinna pa chu Jeush ahin, chule athum lhinna pa chu Eliphelet ahi.  
\v 40 Ulam chapa te chu mihat gal-hang jeng, thalpi kap them jeng ahiuvin ahi. Ama hon chapa tampipi aneiyuvin chule tute jong tamtah aneiyun, abonchauvin mi 150 jen alhing uve.  
\b  
\m Mi hichengse hi Benjamin son chilhah jeng ahiuvin ahi.   
\c 9  
\p
\v 1 Hijeh chun Israel te chu abonchauvin akhangguiyu chu \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu.\it* a akijihlut sohkeiye.  
\s1 Akikaimang Ho Hung Kile  
\p Judah miten Pakaiya kitah louna anei jeh uvin Babylon gamsunga soh changin min akaimang tauve.   
\p
\v 2 Agamsung uva hunglut kit a akhopi dung uva hung chenglut masaho chu thempu ho, Levi mite, Hou-In lhacha ho, chule Israel mite adang-dang ho ahiuve. \x + \xo 9:2 \xt Ezra 2:27; Nehemiah 7:73\x*  
\v 3 Judah mite lah a Benjamin phung, Ephraim phung, chule Manasseh phung ho ahungun Jerusalem khopia acheng tauve.   
\b  
\li1
\v 4 Judah chapa Perez chapa te lah a inko khat hung kinungle chu achapa Bani, Bani chapa Imri , Imri chapa Omri, Omri chapa Ammihud, Ammihud chapa Uthai chu ahi.   
\li1
\v 5 Adang inko ahung kinungle ho chu Shilon mite lah a (achapa apeng masapen) Asaiah le achapa te ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 6 Zerah phung sunga ahung kinungle chu Jevel le a inkote chengse ahiuve.  
\m Judah phung sunga ahung kinungle inko chu abonchauvin 690 alhing uvin ahi.   
\li1
\v 7 Benjamin phung kon’in Meshullam chapa Sallu ahin, Sallu chapa Hodaviah ahin, Hodaviah chapa Hassenuah ahin,  
\v 8 Jeroham chapa Ibneiah ahin, chule Elah chu Uzzi chapa, Micri chapa ahin; chule Meshullam chu Shephatiah chapa ahin, Shephatiah chu Reuel chapa ahin, Reuel chu Ibnijah chapa ahi.   
\m
\v 9 Amaho chengse hi ama-ama insung lhah a phung upa cheh ahiuvin, chule akhanguiyu thusim lekhabua kijihlut sohkei ahiuve. Benjamin phunga konna hung kinungle agomin inko 956 alhinguve.   
\s1 Thempu Ho Hung Kile  
\li1
\v 10 Thempuho lah a hung kinungle ho chu Jedaiah, Jehoiarib, Jakin,  
\v 11 Azariah kitipa Hilkiah chapa, Hilkiah chu Meshullam chapa, Meshullam chu Zadok chapa, Zadok chu Meraioth chapa, Meraioth chu Ahitub chapa ahi. Azariah chu Pathen Hou-In’a vaibol lamkai pipua pang ahiye.   
\li1
\v 12 Thempu adang hung kinungle ho chu Jehoram chapa Adaiah ahin, Jehoram hi Pashhur chapa, Pashhur chu Malkijah chapa, chule Aiel chapa Maasai ahin, Meshullam chu Meshillemith chapa ahin, chule Meshillemith chu Immer chapa ahi.   
\m
\v 13 Hicheng tilouvin jong thempu adang ahung kinungle agomin mi 1,760 ahiuve. Amaho hi apu apauva a insung kailhah a phung upa chengse ahiuvin, chule mihangsan ngen jong ahiuve. Chule amaho hi Pathen Hou-In sunga natonga mopohna nei cheh ahiuve.   
\s1 Levi Mite Hung Kile Ho  
\li1
\v 14 Levi phunga mite chu Hasshub chapa Shemaiah ahin, Hasshub chu Azrikam chapa ahi; Azrikam chu Hashabiah chapa ahin, Hashabiah chu Merari chapa te lah a khat ahi.  
\v 15 Bakbakkar, Herish leh Galal jong ahiuvin, chutengleh Mica chapa Mattaniah ahin, Mica chu Zicri chapa ahin, Zicri chu Asaph chapa ahi;  
\v 16 chule Shemaiah chapa Obadiah ahin,Obadiah chu Galal chapa ahi; Galal chu Jeduthun chapa ahin, chule Asa chapa Berekiah ahi; Berekiah chu Elkanah chapa ahin, ama hi Netophah gamsunga cheng anahi.   
\li1
\v 17 Kulpi kelkot ngah a pang miho chu Shallum ahin, Akkub, Talmon, Ahiman, chule a inkoteu toh ahiuve.  
\v 18 Chule masang chun amaho hi niso lama lengpa kelkot ngah in apang uve. Hiche miho hin Levi mite ngahmun kelkot jong angah uvin ahi.  
\v 19 Kore chapa Shallum ahin, Kore chu Ebiasaph chilhah ahin; Korah phunggui a kon ahi. Ama le a inkote, Korah mite chengse chu Hou-In kinbol’in apu apateu Pakai ngahmun ngah a apan bang uvin apang uve.   
\pm
\v 20 Masang laiya chu Eleazar chapa Phinehas kitipa hi amaho kulpi kelkot mopoa ana pangji ahi; hijeh chun Pakaijin jong amapa chu ana umpi jing jenge.  
\v 21 Chule hiche jou chun Zechariah kitipa Meshelemiah chapa chu kikhopna ponbuh kotphunga kot ngah in ana pang jin ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Chuche lai chun hongcha kelkot dung ngah dinga kilhengdoh miho mong-mong chu mihem 212 alhing uvin ahi; chule amaho hi akhang guiyu kisimna a akho-akho uva kisim sohkei ahiuve. David le mitva neipa Samuel chun amaho hi akitah jeh uva apu apate hou chu hitobang apanmun uva hi apansah lhon ahiuve.  
\v 23 Hijeh a chu amaho le ason achilhahho chu Pakai Hou-In, ponbuh a Hou-In kelkot phung dung ngah a apansah u ahiye.  
\v 24 Hiche kelkot ngah a pang ho chu niso lam, nilhum lam, Sahlam le lhang lam’a pang sohkei uva, mun lia pang ahiuvin ahi.  
\v 25 Amaho kithopi din a inkoteu, akho mun cheh a hung uva nisagi gia amaho hi ahung panhu jing jengu ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Kelkot ngah a pang lamkai cheh Levi mili ho chu indan jouse leh Pathen Hou-In sunga thil kibol jouse ngah a jong pang ahiuve.  
\v 27 Amaho hi Pathen Hou-In kimvel a geh jiuva, hitia hi amaho chunga in-nga kiti mong mong chu kikoiya, jingkah seh leh kot ahon jiu ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Kelkot ngah a pang mi phabep khat chu Hou-In kinbolna a kimangji manchah thil le lo simtoh in apang jiuvin ahi; ijeh-inem itileh hitobang thilkeo ho chu akilah doh le akikoi lut chan’a aman louna dinga simtoh ji-ji ngai monga ahi.  
\v 29 Midang ho jong chu thilkeo dang le manchah thil thengho, changbong le lengpitwi, thaotwi, gimnamtuui le adang-dang lhutnam ding anamtuui ho vetup din apansah uvin ahi.  
\v 30 Hinlah thempuho chu lhutnam ding gimnamtui chohhal din apansah uve.  
\v 31 Levi mi, Mattithiah kitipa leh Korah insung kon Shallum chapa apeng masapen pa chu changlhah pheng semna din avaibol’in apangin ahi.  
\v 32 Chujongleh Kohath phunga kon mi phabep jong chu cholngah nikho seh leh todoh ding changlhah semin apanguvin ahi.   
\p
\v 33 Levi miho lah a tumging them tah-tah ho chu Hou-In sung dan’a achengden jeng uvin ahi. Amaho hi Hou-In kinbolna ho a ongthol’in aum theiyuve; ijeh-inem itileh amaho hi asun ajan a lasa a pang jingjeng ahiuvin ahi.  
\v 34 Mi hichengse hi Jerusalem Levi miho apu apauva a insung lhah cheh a phung upa jeng ahiuve.   
\s1 Lengpa Saul Insung Kailhah  
\li1
\v 35 Gibeon pa Jeiel chu Gibeon khopia achengin ahi. Ajinu min chu Maacah ahin,  
\v 36 chule achapa apeng masapen chu Abdon ahiye. Jeiel chapa te adang ho chu Zur, Kish, Baal, Ner, Nadab,  
\v 37 Gedor, Ahio, Zechariah, chule Mikloth ahiuve.  
\v 38 Mikloth hi Shimeam pa ahiye. Inko hijat hi Jerusalem khopia kinaicha chan ana cheng uve.   
\li1
\v 39 Ner hin Kish ahingin,  
\li1 Kish in Saul ahinge.  
\li1 Saul’in Jonathan, Malkishua, Abinadab, chule Esh-baal ahinge.   
\li1
\v 40 Jonathan chu Merib-baal pa ahin,  
\li1 chule Merib-baal chu Micah pa ahiye.   
\li1
\v 41 Micah chapa te chu Pithon, Melech, Tahrea, chule Ahaz ahiye.   
\li1
\v 42 Ahaz hi Jadah pa ahi.  
\li1 Jadah chu Alemeth, Azmaveth, chule Zimri pa ahi.  
\li1 Zimri chu Moza pa ahi.   
\li1
\v 43 Moza chu Binea pa ahi.  
\li1 Binea chapa chu Rephaiah ahin,  
\li1 Rephaiah chapa chu Eleasah ahin,  
\li1 chule Eleasah chapa chu Azel ahiye.   
\li1
\v 44 Azel hin chapa gup ahingin, amin'u chu Azrikam, Bokeru, Ishmael, Sheriah, Obadiah, chule Hanan ahiuve. Amaho chengse hi Azel chapa te ahiuve.   
\c 10  
\s1 Saul Thi  
\p
\v 1 Philistine ten Israel chunga gal ahin bol tauve, chule Philistine te masanga Israel te ajam gam tauvin ahi. Gilboa Molsang chunga gal alel uvin akijam chap jeng tauvin ahi.  
\v 2 Philishtine ten Saul le achapa te ajam nauva apha uvin, hichun achapa thum-Jonathan, Abinadab, chule Malkishua ho chu athat tauve.  
\v 3 Saul din gal kisat chu adou hah cheh-cheh jeng tan, chuin Philistine thalpi kapthem mihon ma Saul chu amudoh uvin chule melse tah in amavo uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Hichun Saul’in jong agalvon popa jah a leltah in ahin seijin, “Na chemjam satdoh jengin lang neithat pai jengin, achuti louva ahileh hiche cheptanlou Philistine mite khu hung uvin tin kichepna a einei diu ahitai,” ati.  
\p Ahivanginla agalvon popan chutia bol jeng ding chu atijat behseh jeh in anompon aboldeh tapoi. Hiche jeh chun Saul’in jong achemjam akisadoh jengin, achunga alhun akibah lut jeng'e.  
\v 5 Hichea hin agalvon popan jong Saul thi amudoh phat in ama jong achemjam chunga akibah lut pai jengin athi pai-pai tai.  
\v 6 Hitobang hin Saul le achapa mi thum ho chu chumun’a chun abonchan athi khom cheh tauvin, alenggam vaihomna phat sungu jong ahung kichai tai.   
\p
\v 7 Hichun Jezreel Phaicham'a cheng Israel mite leh asepai teu ajam gam tauvin, Saul le achapa te jong athi tauve, ti amudoh phat uvin achennau khopi jouse adalhauvin ajam gam tauve. Chuin Philistine te ahung kitollut uvin akhopi ho chu alotauve.   
\p
\v 8 Ajing nikhoa Philistine mite chu mithi long chomdoh a ahung uva ahileh, Saul le achapa te long chu Gilboa Molsanga amudoh tauve.  
\v 9 Hijeh chun ama hon jong Saul galvon chu ahoh lhauvin, chule alu jong akitan lhah tauve. Chuin ama hon amilim doi houvu leh Philistia gamsung pumpia mitin henga Saul athi kipana thu alhangsam le-le tauvin ahi.  
\v 10 Ama hon Saul galvon chu a pathen limsemthu ho hou-in sunga akoiyun, chule alu jong chu Dagon hou-in sunga atah uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Hinlah Jabesh-gilead khoa cheng mitakip in Philistine ten Saul abolnau ajah doh phat uvin,  
\v 12 agal-hang lai jouse akipat uvin Saul tahsa along le achapa te long jouse chu abonchauvin Jabesh khoa ahin polut sohkei uvin ahi. Chujongleh agubuh jouseu chu Jabesh khopia gangpi phung noiya avuiyun, nisagi sungin an angol uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Hitobang tah hin Saul chun Pakai thupeh anit pon, chule gaochang mi pou adong len, iti chon ding ham, ti doh ding agopon ahi. Hiche jeh a chu Pakaijin ama chu athadoh a, lenggam chu Jesse chapa David joh apeh ahitai. \x + \xo 10:13 \xt 1 Samuel 13:8-14; 15:1-24; \xt Thempu Dan 19:31; 20:6; 1 Samuel 28:7,8\x*   
\c 11  
\s1 Israel Chunga David Leng'a Akipansah  
\p
\v 1 Hichun Israel mipite chu Hebron khopia David heng'a chun ahung uvin, “Keiho hi nangma tahsa tah le thisan kahiuve.  
\v 2 Masang Saul leng ana hi laia jong, nangma hi Israel te gal lamkai ana hijing jeng nahi, chule Pakai na Pathen'in na seipeh banga 'Nangma hi Israel mipi kelngoi chingpha le lamkai dia lhendoh nahi,'” atiuve.   
\p
\v 3 Hiti chun Hebron mun’a chun David in Pakai le Israel upaho masang'ah kitepna theng ana semin ahi. Hichea Pakaijin Samuel kom’a anasei bang chun David chu Israel te dia leng dingin thaonu ana hin ahi.   
\s1 David In Jerusalem Alonvuh  
\p
\v 4 Chujouvin David le Israel mipi te chun Jerusalem (chulai phat a Jebus tia jong ana kihe) mun chu ana nokhum un anasat uve. Hilai chu Jebus mite gamnei dihtah te chenna gam ahi. \x + \xo 11:4 \xt Joshua 15:63; Thutan Vaihom Ho 1:21\x*  
\v 5 Chule Jebus miten David chu, “Hilai mun'a nahung lutthei louhel ding ahi!” ana tiuve. Ahivangin David in Zion kulpi, tua David Khopi tia kihe mun lai chu ana lotan ahi.   
\p
\v 6 David in asepai miho kom’ah, “Koi hijongleh Jebus mite ganokhum masapen aum leh chu ka sepai jalamkai luboh’a pang ding ahi!” ati. Hichun Jebus mite hinsat nokhum masapen in Joab kitipa, David sopinu Zuriah chapa chu ahung hitoh kilhon'in David gal lamkai panmun masapen chu ana chang tan ahi.   
\p
\v 7 David in kulpi chu chennan amangin hichu David Khopi tin akikou e.  
\v 8 David in akhopi chu nisolam’a pat avel dung jouse chu akehletbe in ana semtoh in ahi. Chule Joab in amoh chengse chu ana semphan ahi.  
\v 9 Hatchungnung Pakaijin apanpi jeh in David thaneina chu ahung hatdoh cheh-cheh jengin ahi.   
\s1 David Dinga Gal-hang Ho  
\p
\v 10 Amaho hi David gal-hang lamkaiya pang Israel mipi toh kitho khom a Pakaijin ana kitepna banga David aleng diuva hin tungdoh ding ho chu ahiuve.   
\p
\v 11 David gal-hang lamkai minthang ho chu hiche ho hi ahiuve. Amasapen chu ahile Jashobeam kitipa Hachmon mi David dia gal-hat mi thumho lah a lamkai ahi. Amapa hin achemjam mangcha in akidoupi galmi 300 chu kisattona khat in ana that jouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Anina pen chu ahileh Ahoah son chilhah Dodai chapa Eleazar ahi.  
\v 13 Amapa hi Pas-dammim a Philistine te ana satlai uchun galmun’a David toh ana kitho khom lhon ahi. Chule hiche galmun hi sakol chang dimset ana ke khah jeh chun Israel mite chu ana jam tauve.  
\v 14 Ahivangin Eleazar le David hi galmun’a kon nung chon louvin Philistine mite chu anasat lhon'in ahi. Chule Pakaijin amani ana huhdoh in minthang tah in galjona sangtah jong ana chang lhon e.   
\p
\v 15 Sepai lamkai minthang somthum lah a thum ho chu Adulam songkoa David anaum lai chun Raphiam phaicham a Philistine sepai ho toh ana kimuto uvin ahi.  
\v 16 David hi chuche phatlai chun akulpi sunga ana um'in ahi. Chule Philistine miten Bethlehem khopi ana toupha uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 17 David in amite jah a chun ngaicha tah in hitin aseije, “Ohe, koitobang eingailu toukhat aum a hiche Bethlehem kelkot phunga twitheng khu eigathal peh thei hile,” ati.  
\v 18 Hichun gal-hat lamkai thumho chun Philistine bang chu apal keh un, Bethlehem kulpia um twi chu David don dingin ahin choipeh uve. Ahivangin David in hiche twi chu don louvin Pakaiya ding joh in ana katdoh in ahi.  
\v 19 Aman, “Pathen'in hiche twi kadon ding hi aphatsah poi. Ajeh chu hiche twi hi ahinkho phal ngam’a twi thal a che ho thisan mantam tah toh kibang ahi,” ati. Hijeh chun David in twi chu ana don pon ahi. Hichu gal-hang mithum ho natoh lolhin vetsahna ahi.   
\s1 David Ding'a Mihat Somthum Ho  
\m
\v 20 Abi'shai hi Joab sopipa ahin, somthum ho lah a lamkai ahi. Amapa hin atengcha keoseh mangchan agalmi 300 jen chu ana that jouvin ahi. Hichea kon chun gal-hat mithum ho bangin ahung minthang tan ahi.  
\v 21 Abi'shai hi gal-hat mithum ho lah a apan joulou vang'in mi somthum ho lah a hin lamkai minthang tah khat ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Jehoiada chapa Benaiah kiti gal-hang tah Kabzeel kho a kon mi khat jong anaum e. Amapa hin mihat tah ho natoh jong aboldoh in, hiche lah a chun Moab mite gal-hang mini jong ana that in; chule buhbang lhah lai jingkah in jong Keipi bahkai khat jong ana that e.  
\v 23 Aman achangseh in khetbuh mai mangchan Egypt gal-hang milentah asan dan feet 7-1/2 a sang tengcha lentah kichoija galvon lhingset a kivonpa chu ana that in ahi. Benneah in Egypt mipa tengcha chu alahpeh in, ama thanan anei e.  
\v 24 Hitobang thil nasatah ahin boldoh a kon hin mi minthang gal-hang thumho bangin ahung loupi doh e.  
\v 25 Hiti chun ama hi mithum ho lah a apanlou vang'in somthum ho sang'in, jana sangtah ana chang in chule David in ama vengtup a lamkai din apansah tan ahi.   
\p
\v 26 David sepai mihat ho chu:  
\b  
\li1 Joab sopipa Asahel;  
\li1 Bethlehem kho a kon Dodo chapa Elha'nan;   
\li1
\v 27 Harod kho akon Shammoth;  
\li1 Pelon mi Helez;   
\li1
\v 28 Teko'a khoa Ikkesh chapa Ira;  
\li1 Anathoth khomi Abiezer;   
\li1
\v 29 Hushath mi Sibbecai;  
\li1 Ahoh kho a kon Ilai;   
\li1
\v 30 Netophah mi Maharai;  
\li1 Netophiah mi Ba'anah chapa Heled;   
\li1
\v 31 Gibeah kho (Benjamin chate gamsung) a Ribai chapa Ithai;  
\li1 Pirathon kho a kon Benaiah;   
\li1
\v 32 Nahale-gash kom'a Hurai;  
\li1 Arabah a konna Abi-albon;   
\li1
\v 33 Bahurim khoa Azmaveth;  
\li1 Shaalbon kho a Eliahba;   
\li1
\v 34 Gizon kho a kon Jashen;  
\li1 Harar khoa Shagee chapa Jonathan;   
\li1
\v 35 Harar khoami ma-ma Sharar chapa Ahiam;  
\li1 Ur chapa Eliphal;   
\li1
\v 36 Mekerah khomi Hepher;  
\li1 Pelon mi Ahijah;   
\li1
\v 37 Carmel kho a Hezro;  
\li1 Ezbai chapa Paarai;   
\li1
\v 38 Nathan sopipa Jo'el;  
\li1 Hagri chapa Mibhar;   
\li1
\v 39 Ammon mi Zelek;  
\li1 Beeroth khomi Naharai, ama hi Zeru'iah chapa galvonpoa pang ahi;   
\li1
\v 40 Jattir khomi Ira;  
\li1 Jattir khomi ma-ma Gareb ahi;   
\li1
\v 41 Hit mi Uriah;  
\li1 Ahlai chapa Zabad;   
\li1
\v 42 Reuben phung a kon Shiza chapa Adina ahin,  
\li1 ama jong hi Reuben chate lah a lamkai khat ahin, Sepai somthum apuije;   
\li1
\v 43 Maacah chapa Hanan;  
\li1 Mithna a kon Joshaphat;   
\li1
\v 44 Ashtaroth khomi Uzzia;  
\li1 Aroer mi Hotham cha teni Shama le Jeiel;   
\li1
\v 45 Shimri chapa Jediael  
\li1 Tiz a konna asopipa Joha;   
\li1
\v 46 Mahavah mi Eliel;  
\li1 Elnaam chapa teni Jeribai le Joshaviah;  
\li1 Moab mi Ithmah;   
\li1
\v 47 Eliel le Obed;  
\li1 Zobah a konna Jaasiel ahiuve.   
\c 12  
\s1 David Leng Ahina Dinga Panpi Ho  
\p
\v 1 Kish chapa Saul kom Ziklag mun a ana kisel laiya David toh ana umkhom ho chu gal-hang mi David toh gal anasat khom ho chu ahiuve.  
\v 2 Hiche miho hi Benjamin phung'a kon Saul sopite ahiuvin thalpi kap them cheh chule akhut jet le vei mangcha thei a songchang bom kap them cheh mi ahiuve.  
\v 3 Alamkai uchu Gibiah mi Shemaah chapa Ahiezar ahin; ama bantah a lamkai chu Joash ahi. Gal-hang adang ho chu:  
\b  
\li1 Azmaveth chapa teni Pelet le Jeziel;  
\li1 Bareah;  
\li1 Anathoth kho a Jehu;   
\li1
\v 4 Gebeon a kon Ishmaiah kitipa hi gal-hang somthum lah a lamkai le akithang pen ahi;  
\li1 Chule Gederah kho a kon Jeremiah, Jahaziel, Johanan le Jozabad ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 5 Haruph kho a kon Eluzai, Jerimoth, Bealiah, Shemariah le Sephatiah ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 6 Korah mite phunga kon Elkanah , Isshiah, Azarel, Joezer le Jashobeam ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 7 Gedor a kon Jeroham chapa teni Joelah le Zebadiah ahi lhon'e.   
\b  
\p
\v 8 David gamthip noi kulpi a anaum laiyin Gad mite gal-hang galbol them cheh ho chun ana panpi uvin ahi. Amaho chu lumchoije le tengcha kho them cheh Keipi bahkai banga gin umtah chule mol'a sakhi golpai banga chom jangkhai jeng ahiuve.   
\b  
\li1
\v 9 Ezer chu lamkai pipu pen ahi.  
\li1 Ani channa chu Obadiah ahi.  
\li1 Athum channa chu Eliab ahi.   
\li1
\v 10 Mishmannah chu ali chan na ahi.  
\li1 Jeremiah chu angana ahi.   
\li1
\v 11 Agup channa chu Attai ahin,  
\li1 Sagi channa chu Eliel ahi.   
\li1
\v 12 Aget channa chu Johanan ahi.  
\li1 Ko channa chu Elzabad ahi.   
\li1
\v 13 Jeremiah chu asom channa ahi.  
\li1 Macbannai chu som le khat channa ahi.   
\b  
\p
\v 14 Amaho hi Gad mite gal-hang lamkai pipu ngen ahiuvin ahi. Chule anemnung pen chu sepai jakhat ahiuvin asang jo pen ho chu sangkhat vel ahiuve!  
\v 15 Hiche mite ho chu kum kihei kumbul a Jordan vadung letlha hel'a twi hunglon chun vapam achennau mun a kon'in solam le lhumlam gam'a ana homkhen uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Chule adang ho Benjamin le Judah phung mite chu David kulpi achun ahungun ahi.  
\v 17 Chuin David jong amaho kimupin ahung pot in, hitin aseije. Kipah tah a keima kithopi dia hung nahiu le eiho loikhat ihiuve. Amavang kagal mite angsung'a keima pedoh dinga hung nahiu le vang ka pului u Pathen'in nangho chunga gotna napeh diu ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Chuin Amasai kitipa somthum ho lah a lamkai pa chu lhagao houpina achangin hitin aseiye,  
\b  
\q1 “ David, keiho nanga kahiuve!  
\q2 Jesse chapa, nangma lam a pang ding kahiuve.  
\q1 Chamna le phatthei nan najui jing hen,  
\q2 chule nangma nakithopi jouse jong lolhing uhen,  
\q2 ajeh chu Pathen'in nangma napanpi ahi,” ati.  
\b  
\m Hiti chun David in amaho chu akiloipin asepai te chunga lamkai dingin jong apansah tan ahi.   
\p
\v 19 David Philistine te toh kithokhom a gal ana konlai chun Manasseh chate Israel sepai ten jong ana panpi uvin ahi. Ahivangin Philistine sepai lamkai ho chun, “David hi nikho khat le Saul lang joh a hung pang a eiho sugam le ilol u tan a hung pang thei ahi,” atiuvin David toh kilhon khom jing chu ana nom tapouvin ana solmang tauve.   
\p
\v 20 Ziglak a David ana kilea Manasseh chate David ana jop ho chu: Adnah, Jozabad, Jediael, Michael, Jozabad, Elihu le Zillethai ahiuve. Amaho lamkaina noiya Manasseh phung'a kon sepai mi 1,000 ahiuve.  
\v 21 Hiti chun amaho hin David chunga gal hinbol gamho jouse chu hatah in ana douvun ana kisatpi uvin ahi. Chule amaho hi mihangsan tah gal-hang lamkai thei cheh ahiuvin ahi.  
\v 22 Chule aniseh in David langa pang ding le akithopi ding sepai akibe jingin, Pathen sepai tampi banga ahung umdoh kahsen mi ahung kikhom jinge.   
\p
\v 23 Pakai kitepna dungjuiya Saul lenggam vaipohna pumpi David chansah dinga Hebron khopia hung kikhom doh sepai ami mong monga akihop jat u hicheng hi ana hiuve.   
\b  
\li1
\v 24 Juda phung sunga kon galvon le tengcha tho thei cheh mi 6,800 alhing e.   
\li1
\v 25 Chule Simeon phunga gal-hang agom a mi 7,100 alhing e.   
\li1
\v 26 Levi phunga kon gal-hang mi 4,600 alhingin ahi.  
\v 27 Hichea hin Aaron insunga kon Jehoaida lamkaina noiya mi 3,700 alhing e.  
\v 28 Chule Zadok kiti galbol mihangsan tah insunga kon'in jong gal lamkai cheh mi 22 alhing e.   
\li1
\v 29 Benjamin phunga konna Saul inkote galsat sepai mi3,000 ahiuvin chule amaho lah a atamjo hi Benjamin insungmi a kon Saul lam'a pang ana hijing uve.   
\li1
\v 30 Ephriam phunga kon'in jong galsat hangsan tah mi 28,000 alhingin chule ama hung kondohna phunggui sunga dia jong jaumtah le mi minthang cheh ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 31 Manasseh nam kehkhat Jordan lhumlam a kon sepai mi 18,000 umho chun David leng ahung hina dingin ana kithopi uvin ahi.   
\li1
\v 32 Issachar mite le a insungmi a kon'in jong lamkai mi 200 ana lhing e. Hiche miho jouse hi Israel te chunga thil hunglhung ding le phat kihei dan ho hetthemna nei cheh ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 33 Zebulun phunga kon'in jong galbol a themtah gal-hang sepai mi 5,000 alhing e. Amaho hi David toh kitho khom a galsat dia gal manchah toh kigosa cheh ahiuvin ahi.   
\li1
\v 34 Naphtali phunga kon'in jong gal-hang cheh gal manchah lhingset a lumpho le tengcha mangcha thei sepai lamkai mi 1,000 le galsat sepai mi 37,000 alhing uve.   
\li1
\v 35 Dan phunga kon'in jong galmun a dia kigosadem a galsat ding mi 28,600 alhing uve.   
\li1
\v 36 Asher phunga kon'in jong galbol dan kichuh sepai 40,000 jong galsat dia kigosa ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 37 Chule Jordan vadung nisolam a kon'in jong Gad le Reuben phung chule Manasseh nam kehkhat chu galsat dia manchah chom cheh kichoi lhingset sepai mi 120,000 alhing uve.   
\b  
\p
\v 38 Hebron mun hinjon a galsat dia kigosadem a um sepai tampi ho ahiuvin chule Isareal mipi jousen jong David chu Isareal pumpia aleng diuvin adeisah sohkei uve.  
\v 39 Chuin a insungmi asopi ten David chu vailhunna ding thil ijakai agongtoh uvin nithum sungin David toh an nehkhom le lengpitwi donkhomna anei uve.  
\v 40 Avel a um Isachar, Zebulun le Naphtali ho chengin jong sangan le sangongsao chule sakolpol le bongchal ho chu neh ding pohnan amangcha uvin ahi. Chule neh ding don ding changlhah hihen theichang ga changlhah, bongchal, kelngoi le kelcha ho geiyin golnop bolna din ahin polut uvin ahi. Hichu Israel pumpia dinga kipa golnop loupitah ana hin ahi.   
\c 13  
\s1 David In Thingkhong Tollut Ding Agot  
\p
\v 1 David in asepai sangkhat chunga lamkai ho leh jakhat chunga lamkai ho chu thu adong toh sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 2 Chuin aman Israel mite jouse kom'a chun hitin aseiye, “Nangho le Pakai I-Pathen'u lunglam ahile Israel mite chenna jouse thempuho le Levi mite jaona a ibonchauva ikikhop khom soh theina diuvin thu lhangsapna nei uhite.  
\v 3 Saul leng vaipoh laijin Pathen Kitepna Thingkhong chu nahsahmon anaum jongleh tuhi anung lahphat tah chu ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 4 Akihoukhom mipi jousen hichu pha asah utoh kilhon'in aboncha uvin boldin kinoptona anei tauve.  
\v 5 Hiti chun David in Pathen Thingkhong chu nung putlut kitna dingin Kiriath-jerim mun a kon'in muntin'a Israel mite aumnau Egypt lhanglam gam Shihor Vadung apat chule sahlam gam Lebo-hamath khopi vel dunga kon abon'uva ahung kikhop khomna diuvin kouna aneijin ahi. \x + \xo 13:5 \xt 1 Samuel 7:1,2\x*  
\v 6 Pathen Thingkhong nunglah kitna dingin David le Israel mite chun Judah gam Baalah (Kiriath-jeriam tia jong kikou) mun a chun ana cheuvin ahi. \x + \xo 13:6 \xt Potdohbu 25:22\x*  
\v 7 Chuin ama hon Pathen Thingkhong chu Abinadab insunga kon'in ahin ladoh un bongkang thahleh a akoi uve. Chule hiche bongkang chu Uzzah le Ahio tenin ahin tol lhon'in ahi.  
\v 8 Hichun David le Israel mipite chun Pathen ang'ah kipah le thanom tah in la asauvin, selangdah le semjang asaiyun, khong le dah chule kipa khutbeh toh thon saki pengkul ana mut uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Ahivangin ama hon Nacon changphol lai ahin phah uchun bongchal chu ahung kipal lhun Uzzah in Pathen Thingkhong chu tuh dingin akhut ana lhaangin ahi.  
\v 10 Uzzah in Pathen Thingkhong chunga akhut ajah apat in achunga Pakai lunghanna ana chutan hijeh chun Pathen'in Uzzah adengin ama angsunga ana thiden tan ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Pakaijin Uzzah chunga alunghanna aphon jal jeh chun David jong ana lungna lheh jengin ahi. Hijeh chun David in hilai mun chu Perez-uzzah asah in ahi, (“hichu Uzzah kisuh gepna mun”) tin tuni geijin akikouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Chule David kicha tah a aum phat chun Pathen adongin aseitai. “Pathen thingkhong chu iti keiman kaga nunglah kit a kakom'a kakoi ngam ding ham?” ati.  
\v 13 Hijeh chun David injong Pathen Thingkhong chu David khopia pohlut joh sangin Gath mipa Obed-edom insunga ana lhutjo tan ahi.  
\v 14 Hiti chun Pathen Thingkhong chu lhathum Obed-edom insunga ana umden in hiche sung chun Pakaijin Obed-edom insung mite chu anatohna lam cheh uva phatthei ana boh in ahi. \x + \xo 13:14 \xt 1 Thusimbu 26:4,5\x*   
\c 14  
\s1 David Leng Inpi Leh A Insung  
\p
\v 1 Tyre gam a leng Hiram in asottole a pang thingthem bol le songkhen them ho chu Cedar thing ho a David inpi sahpeh dingin ana sol'in ahi.  
\v 2 Chule Pakaijin Israel pumpi a lengdia atun a amite Israel te dinga alenggam phatthei aboh chu David in jong ana geldoh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Chujouvin David in Jerusalem a chun ji akipuibe in chanu le chapa jong tampi aneikit in ahi.  
\v 4 Amaho hi David in Jerusalem’a anahinsa achapa te chu ahiuve: Shammua, Shobab, Nathan, Solomon,  
\v 5 Ibhar, Elishua, Elpelet,  
\v 6 Nogah, Nepheg, Japhia,  
\v 7 Elishama, Eliada,\f * \fr 14:7 \ft Hebrew \fqa Beeliada, \ft a variant spelling of Eliada; compare 3:8 and parallel text at 2 Sam 5:16.\f*le Eliphelet ahiuve.   
\s1 David In Philistine Ajo  
\p
\v 8 David Israel pumpia aleng chan ding chu Philistine miten ajah phat uvin Philistine sepai ho chu David man dingin ahung kon uvin ahi. David in jong hiche thu ajah phat chun amaho kimaitopi din akondoh pai kit in ahi.  
\v 9 Hiti chun Philistine sepai ho chun gang tah in Raphiam phaicham chu ahin nokhum pai jengun ahi.  
\v 10 Hichun David in Pathen adongin, “Hiche Philistine te khu gasat leng achung uva galjona neichan sah ding ham?” ati.  
\p Chuin Pakaijin adonbut in, “Chenlang gasat in achung uva galjona nachan ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Hichun David le asepai te chu Baal-perazim lam jonin akitol uvin Philistine te chu agasat uvin ana jou tauve. Chuin David in hitin asei e, “Pathen'in ka melmate chunga twisuh long banga ka lonkhumna din eina mang chai,” ati. Hijeh chun hichelai mun hi Baal-perazim ana kisah in ahi.  
\v 12 Chuin Philistine te anajam uvin milim doi pathen semthu ana dalhah hou chu David in ana halvam sah in ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Ahivangin Philistine te chun hetmanlou kah in phaicham chu ahin nokhum paikit uvin ahi.  
\v 14 Hijeh chun David injong ipi bol ding hitam tin Pathen adong kit in ahile Pathen'in, “Amaho nungjui kit louvin amasang lam uva konin hinle del khumun balsom thingphung a hin nokhum un,” tin asei e.  
\v 15 Nangman thingleh vum langa pat mitampi kijot kengto gin najah teng pot inlang galsat pan jengin ajeh chu Pathen'in Philistine sepai te satgamna dia nangma nahin panpi ding chu avetsah ahi.  
\v 16 Hiti chun David in jong Pathen thupeh bangin abollin ahile Philistine sepai te chu Gibeon a kipat in Gezer chan in ana deljam suh in ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Chuin muntin jousea David ahung minthan phat in Pakaijin David chu nam jouse te gin le ja in aumsah tan ahi.   
\c 15  
\s1 Thingkhong Toldohna Dia Kigotna  
\p
\v 1 David in akhopi a chun injong tampi anasa in chule Pathen Thingkhong koina ding jong ponbuh phatah ana songin ahi.  
\v 2 Hichun David in hitin asei e, “Pathen Thingkhong puding chu Levi mite tailou adang pang thei louding ahi. Pakaijin amaho put dinga alhen'u ahin tonsot a ama kin abol diu ahi,” ati. \x + \xo 15:2 \xt Danbu Ni Na 10:8\x*   
\p
\v 3 Hichun David in Pakai Thingkhong koina ding mun semna apulut dingin Jerusalem khopi a um Israel mite chu ana kou in ahi.  
\v 4 Hiche a ana kikou miho chu ahile Aaron thempu le Levi chate ho ahiuve.   
\b  
\li1
\v 5 Uriel lamkaina a kon'in Kohath nambah ami 120 ahi.   
\li1
\v 6 Asaiah lamkai na a Meraei nambah akon mi 220 ahi.   
\li1
\v 7 Joel lamkaina akon Gershon nambah mi 130 alhing uve.   
\li1
\v 8 Elizaphan son chilhah akon Shemaiah lamkaina mi 200 alhing e,   
\li1
\v 9 Hebron son chilhah a kon Eliel lamkaina in mi 80 alhing uve.   
\li1
\v 10 Aminadab lamkaina in Uzziel chilhah te chu mi 122 ma alhing uve.   
\b  
\p
\v 11 Chuin David in thempu ho Zadok le Abiathar chule Levi mite lah a kon'in: Uriel, Asaiah, Joel, Shemaiah, Eliel le Amminadab ho chu akou khom sohkeiyin ahi.  
\v 12 David in amaho kom'a chun hitin aseiye; “Nangho Levi insung mite dia lamkai pipui nahiuve. Hijeh chun Israel Pakai Pathen Thingkong chu akoina dinga kagotna mun a nahin nungput kitna diuvin nangho ahin chule na insung mite cheng nabonun kisutheng un,” ati.  
\v 13 Pakaijin adoh lou jeh uchun Pakai vantil Pathen lunghanna ichung uva ana chu in Levi mite chun thingkong chu na-na pohlut theilou u ahi.  
\v 14 Hijeh chun thempu ho le Levi mite jouse chun Israel Pakai Pathen Thingkhong Jerusalem mun’a putdohna din kilhaina ana nei uvin ahi.  
\v 15 Chuin Pakaijin Mose athuhil bang chun Levi miten Pathen Thingkhong chu alengkou uva moljol in ahinpu uvin ahi. \x + \xo 15:15 \xt Potdohbu 25:14\x*   
\p
\v 16 Hichun David in jong lamkai ho chu thu apen Levi mite lasathem le tumging them hon kipala sah a tumging le semjang sai a khutbeh gintho dingin aseiye.  
\v 17 Chuin Levi hon Joel chapa Heman le a Levi chankhompi ho alhengdoh un: Levi tetoh sopi Merari nambah sunga kon: Berekiah chapa Asaph ahin, chule Merari phunga kon Kushaiah chapa Ethan ahi.  
\v 18 Chule amaho kithopi dingin: Zechariah, Jaaziel,\f * \fr 15:18 \ft As in several Hebrew manuscripts and Greek version (see also parallel lists in 15:20; 16:5); Masoretic Text reads \fqa Zechariah ben Jaaziel.\f* Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Unni, Eliab, Benaiah, Maaseiah, Mattithiah, Eliphelehu, Mikneiah, le kelkot ngahpa—Obed-edom le Jeiel ahiuve.   
\p
\v 19 Tumging them lah a Heman , Asaph le Ethan ho chu sum-eng semjang sai dingin ana lheng uvin,  
\v 20 Chule Zechariah, Aziel, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Unni, Eliab, Maaseiah le Benaiah ho cheng chu selangdah sai din ana lhengdoh uvin ahi.  
\v 21 Chule Mattithiah, Eliphelehu, Mikneiah, Obed-edom, Jeiel chule Azaziah ho chu la aw lhingset sahna a kimang semjang saidin apan sah uve.  
\v 22 Chuin Levi te lah alamkai Kenaiah hi lasah lam bolthei tah ahijeh chun la lamkai din apansah uve.   
\p
\v 23 Chule Pathen Thingkhong vengtup dingin Berekaiah le Elkanah chu ana pansah uve.  
\v 24 Shebanaiah, Joshaphat, Nethanel, Amasai, Zechariah, Benaiah le Eliezer ho cheng hin Pathen Thingkhong mai a kitol uva saki a kisem pengkul amut diu ahi, chule Obed-edom le Jehiah chu Pathen Thingkhong vengtup in apansah uve.   
\p
\v 25 David le Israel upate chule sepai lamkai pipuho chun Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong chu Jerusalem a ahin pohlut a loupitah a kipapi dingin Obed-edom inpia chun ana cheuve.  
\v 26 Chule Pathen'in Levi mite akithopi a, ama hon Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong ahin pohlut jeh u chun bongchal sagi le kelngoi sagi kilhainan ana that uve.   
\p
\v 27 David le Levi mite Pakai Thingkhong pua pang ahin, lasa a pang ho le la lamkai Kenaniah ho chu tupat ponnem in ana kivon uve. David jong chun thempu ho lengban khat jong ana kiban in ahi.  
\v 28 Hiti chun Israel mite chun kipana aw thong’a sampum le sumkon gin le saki mutgin chule khutbeh behgin le semjang saiging tho in Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong chu ahin pulut uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong David khopia ahin pohlut uchun, Saul chanu Michal in inbang kot apat ahin vetsuh le leng David kipa thanop thoa achop le chu amun ana japi in ahi.   
\c 16  
\s1 David In Kilhaina Thilto Abol  
\p
\v 1 Hichun ama hon Pathen Thingkhong chu David in akoina dia ponbuh hoitah asonna mun a chun ahin polut uvin ahi. Chua chun ama hon Pathen a kilhaina pumgo thilto jong ana kat uvin ahi.  
\v 2 David in kilhaina kin anei jouvin amite chu Pakai min'in phatthei aboh in ahi.  
\v 3 Chujouvin aman ami Israel te numei pasal abonchauvin changlhah alhang a kisem ahin, lengpithei ga a kisem nehthei ana pen ahi.   
\p
\v 4 David in Levi mite chu Pakai Thingkhong maiya Israel Pakai Pathen phattheina sima, avahchoi lasah le thangvah dingin mipi jouse lamkai din ana pansah e.  
\v 5 Asaph chu amaho lah a lamkai ahin, ama hin lasahna a kimang sum-eng vogingin apangin ahi. Ama bantah a chu Zechariah ahin, chule Jeiel, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Mattithiah, Eliab, Benaiah, Obed-edom le Jeiel ahiuve. Amaho hi semjang le selangdah sai a pang ahiuve.  
\v 6 Chule Pathen Kitepna Thingkhong masang a chun thempu Benaiah le Jahaziel chun tanglouvin sumkon ana mut lhon'in ahi.   
\s1 David In Pathen Avahchoina La  
\m
\v 7 David in hiche nikho chun Asaph le ami Levi te chut Pakai thangvahna la ana peuvin ahi.   
\b  
\q1
\v 8 Pakai chu thangvah na peuvin chule aloupina seiphong uvin.  
\q2 Vannoi leiset pumpin athibol jouse hecheh hen.   
\q1
\v 9 Thangvah toh thon ama vahchoi un.  
\q2 Namtin jouse chung a athilbol kidang ho hillhang uvin.   
\q1
\v 10 Amintheng chu hapah in kipapi un;  
\q2 eiho Pakai mite ihiuve.   
\q1
\v 11 Tantih neilouvin Pakai thahatna chu;  
\q2 hol jingun lang hou uvin.   
\q1
\v 12 Thil kidang tampi le datmo umtah,  
\q2 aboldoh ho leh athutanna ho geldoh jingun,   
\q1
\v 13 nangho alhacha Israel chate ho,  
\q2 chule Jacob son chilhah anam deilhen mite nahiuve.   
\b  
\q1
\v 14 Ama hi Pakai eiho Pathen ahi.  
\q2 Ama thupeh dihtah hi vannoi jousen amu ding ahi.   
\q1
\v 15 Aman a itih khangin jong  
\q2 akitepna ageldoh jingin ahi.   
\q1
\v 16 Hiche hi aman Abraham toh kitepna asem chu ahin  
\q2 chule Isaac henga kitepna ana nei chu ahi. \x + \xo 16:16 \xt Semtilbu 12:7; \xt Semtilbu 26:3\x*   
\q1
\v 17 Aman hichu Jacob heng a Israel mite toh  
\q2 a-itih khanggei a tonsot adia kitepna thulhuh le suhdetna ana nei ahi: \x + \xo 16:17 \xt Semtilbu 28:13\x*   
\q1
\v 18 “Nangma chan ding goulo na ding Canaan gam chu  
\q2 kapeh ding nahi,” ati.   
\q1
\v 19 Aman hiche aseilai chun nangmaho Canaan gam'a hon lhomcha a,  
\q2 khopem banga na-na umlai u ahi, ati.   
\q1
\v 20 Hiti chun amaho chu namkhat apat namkhat a anavahle uvin,  
\q2 chule lenggam khat apat gamdanga ana vahle uve.   
\q1
\v 21 Chujongleh aman amaho chu koima suhgentheina le bolgimna ana neisah poi.  
\q2 Amaho jeh in leng dang ho joh thugahna ananei jon ahi: \x + \xo 16:21 \xt Semtilbu 20:3-7\x*   
\q1
\v 22 “Ka lhenchomte natohkhah thei loudiu,  
\q2 chule kathemgao ho jong nasuh genthei loudiu ahi,” ati.   
\b  
\q1
\v 23 Leiset pumpin Pakai chu vahchoi hen!  
\q2 Chule aniseh in ami huh hingna thupha chu seiphong leuvin.   
\q1
\v 24 Namtin vaipi lah a athilbol loupi ho phongjal un.  
\q2 Athilbol kidang ho mitin vaipi hetsah un.   
\q1
\v 25 Pakai chu thunei pen ahi! Amin loupi vahchoi dia lomtah ahi!  
\q2 Pathen dang jouse sanga gin le jadia lom ahi.   
\q1
\v 26 Namtin vaipi dang ho hou hi semthu milim doi pathen ahin,  
\q2 eiho Pakai vang hi vanlaijol sempa ahi!   
\q1
\v 27 Jana le lalna jouse;  
\q2 thahatna chule kipana Pakai ama kom'a cheng ahi.   
\b  
\q1
\v 28 Vannoi namtin vaipin, Pakai hecheh un,  
\q2 athahatna le aloupina chu hecheh hen.   
\q1
\v 29 Pakai chu loupina jouse chang dia lom ahi!  
\q2 Aumpina noiyah na thilto hinpo uvin.  
\q2 Aloupina theng jousen Pakai chu houvun.   
\q1
\v 30 Leiset mite jouse Pakai masang a tijan kithing jeng hen.  
\q2 Leiset jong linglouhel in dettah in ding jing hen.   
\b  
\q1
\v 31 Van'a le leiyah kipa thanop nan lodim soh hen!  
\q2 Pakai vaihomna namtin vaipi jousea seiphong leuvin,   
\q1
\v 32 Twikhanglen le asunga cheng jousen jong avah choina sam uhen!  
\q2 Loulai dung le mim le chang ho jong kipah thanom in hung pohjal jeng uhen!   
\q1
\v 33 Gammang thingphung jouse jong kipa lasah in kilingdoh soh hen,  
\q2 Pakai chu leiset a thutan’a ahung teng.   
\b  
\q1
\v 34 Pakai chu aphatna jallin thangvahna peuvin!  
\q2 Ama a um tahsan umtah mi ngailutna chun tonsot in athoh jing e, \x + \xo 16:34 \xt 2 Thusimbu 5:13; 7:3; Ezra 3:11; Labu 100:5; 106:1; 107:1; 118:1; 136:1; Jeremiah 33:11\x*   
\q1
\v 35 “O Pathen eihuhhing pauvin nei huhhing un!  
\q2 Namtin vaipi lah a kon'in neipui khom uvin lang neihuhdoh uvin,  
\q2 chuteng nangma mintheng chu  
\q2 kakipapi uva ka vahchoi diu ahi.”   
\b  
\q1
\v 36 Pakai Israel Pathen chu vahchoiyun,  
\q2 ama chu tonsot-tonsot geiya hingjing ahi!  
\b  
\m Chule amite jousen “Amen!” tin sam uhen chule Pakai chu vahchoiyu.   
\s1 Jerusalem Le Gibeon A Pathen Hou  
\m
\v 37 Hiti chun David in Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong a aniseh a angaichatna jouse a natong le dingin Asaph le ami Levi te chu ana pansah in ahi.  
\v 38 Hiche ho lah a chun Obed-edom (Jeduthun chapa), Hosah le Levi mite mi somgup le get chu kotkhah ngah in ana pang uve.   
\m
\v 39 Chule David in Zadok thempu le Levi mite chu Gibeon gamsung a Pakai Houbuh a kimangcha din ana koijin ahi.  
\v 40 Pakaijin Israel te chunga dan thupeh jui dia ana nei bangin ama hon Pakai a jingkah nilhah in kilhaina thilpeh maicham jong ana nei uve.  
\v 41 Pakai akitahna le mingailutna tonsotna athohhatna jallin ama thangvahna pedingin David in Heman, Jeduthun, chule midang ana minphah chan jong ana pang uvin ahi.  
\v 42 Hiti chun ama hon sumkon mut gin le khutbeh gin le tumging thei jat tampi ho mangchan Pathen ana vahchoi uve, chule Jeduthun chapa chu kotkhah ngah in ana pansah uve.   
\m
\v 43 Chujouvin mipi jouse chu ama inlam cheh a ana kile uvin David jong ama inlam'a a insung mite phatthei boh dingin ana chetan ahi. \x + \xo 16:43 \xt 2 Samuel 6:19,20\x*   
\c 17  
\s1 David Chung'a Pakai Kitepna  
\p
\v 1 David chu ama inpia ana umlaijin, themgao Nathan chu akouvin akom'a hitin aseiye, “Ven, Keima la Cedar thinga kisa innom tah a kachengin, ahivangin Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong vang chu ponbuh a kisa mai-mai noiya ana kikoi in ahi!” ati.   
\p
\v 2 Nathan in adonbut in, “Nalunga um nagel chan chu bollin ajeh chu Pathen'in naumpi nai,” ati.   
\p
\v 3 Ahivangin, hicheni jantah chun Pathen'in Nathan kom'a anasei e,   
\b  
\pmo
\v 4 “Chenlang kasohpa David kom'a gaseipeh tan, 'Hiche hi Pakaijin aphondoh ahi: Nangma hi keima umna ding mun sading chu nahipoi.  
\v 5 Keiman Egypt gam a kon Israel te kahin puidoh nikho apat tuni geijin insunga kacheng kha hih laiye. Hiti chun ponbuh a kisong Houbuh munkhat a kon mun chom-chom a kana ki chon le jin ahi.  
\v 6 Keiman Israel mite toh kilhon khom ding le kamite kelngoi chinga pang lamkai ho kom'a jong, “Ipi ding'a Cedar thinga kisa in hoitah nei sahpeh lou uham?'” tin kasei khapoi.   
\pm
\v 7 “Tun nangma chen lang ka lhachapa David kom'a hitin gasei tan, 'Hiche hi Van Sepaite Pakaijin aphondoh ahi: Keiman nangma hi hamhing lah a kelngoi chinga napan na a kon kapuidoh a kami Israel te chunga lamkai dia kapan sah ding nahi.  
\v 8 Chule keiman nangma na chena mun jousea kalhonpi jinga, nangma masanga na melma te jouse jong ka suhgam jeng ding leiset chunga mi minthang ho banga namin kakithan sah ding ahi.  
\v 9 Chule kami Israel te dinga achenna diu mun jong kapeh ding dettah a lungmongsel a cheng uva koiman jong asuhling theilou diu ahi. Namdang ten jong masanga banga asuhmang kitlou diu ahi.  
\v 10 Keiman aphat dungjui a kami Israel te chunga Lamkai vaihom dinga ka pansah jing ding ahi.  
\pm Chujongle, na melma teu aboncha ka suhgam ding chuche kal a jong Pakaijin na lenggam sungu phatthei aboh ding ahi!  
\v 11 Na hinkho abei nunga napu napate kom'a dia nache nungteng jongleh, Keiman na dalhah nason na chilhah te lah a nachapa te khat pen, ka dopsang ding alenggam jong ka hatsah ding ahi.  
\v 12 Amapa chun keima dinga Hou-In khat eisah peh ding chule keiman alenggam a laltouna chu a-itih chan a kaphudet jing ding ahi.  
\v 13 Hiche mipa dinga chu keima hi apa kahi a, ama chu kachapa hi ding ahi. Nangma masanga mipa chunga kangailutna kana lahdoh banga, ama chunga hi kanung lahdoh louding ahi. \x + \xo 17:13 \xt 2 Crth 6:18; Heb 1:5\x*  
\v 14 Keiman ama ka insung le ka lenggam sunga lenga ka pansah jing ding, chule alenggam a laltouna chu atonsot geiya long louva um jing ding ahi,'” ati.   
\b  
\m
\v 15 Hiti chun Nathan ahung kile in Pakaijin amusah thil ho jouse chu David kom'a ahung seipeh tan ahi.   
\s1 David Thangvah Taona  
\p
\v 16 Chuin Lengpa David alut in Pakai angsunga atouvin ataove,  
\b  
\pmo “O Pakai, Pathen keima hi koi kahi a, chule ka insung mite hi ipi hija, hichan geiya hi neihin puipeh uham?  
\v 17 Tun, O Pathen, na lhachapa keima khunung a lenggam lhoutah hunglhung ding jong nei seidoh peh in ahi! O Pakai Pathen, milentah khat kom'a sei bangin kaheng'a naseije!   
\pm
\v 18 Hitobang a na lhachapa nei jabolna hi nangma kom'a ipi kaseibe nahlai ding ham? Na lhachapa keima itobang kahi la neihet sohkei ahitai.  
\v 19 Na lhachapa keima neigel khohna jal le nalungel lamtah bangin kachunga thil loupi tampi mite mutheijin na boldoh in ahi.   
\pm
\v 20 “O Pakai, nang tobang koima dang aumpoi. Nangma tobang Pathen dang jong kanei pouve!  
\v 21 Nami Israel nam mite tobang leisetna koidang um am? O Pathen, nangma tah in namite asoh channa gama kon'a na-na huhdoh koi nam um kha'm? Nangman namin lentah na hisahna dingin Egypt a kon'a namite na-na lhatdoh ahi. Nangman thil kidangho na-na bol'in alampiuva ding namdang te chu na-na nomang'in ahi.  
\v 22 Nangman Israel mite chu nangma mite dihtah mongin na-na lhengdoh in, O Pakai, a Pathen'u nahi tan ahi.”   
\pm
\v 23 “Chule tun, O Pakai, Keima na lhacha kahitai; keima le ka insungmi chung chang thua nakitepna bangin bol jeng tan. Hiche kitepna hi a itih chan a ding hita hen.  
\v 24 Nangma min kiphutdoh henlang chule a itih in kijabol hen chuteng mijousen, 'Van Sepaite Pakai, Israel dinga Pathen chu, Israel te Pathen ahi!' tia asei diu ahi. Chule nasohpa David insung jeng jong nangma angsunga phudet a um ding ahi.”   
\pm
\v 25 “O ka Pathen, Keima hi nangma anga ngamtah a hungtao a kahi, ajeh chu na lhachapa keima hi ka in ding nei sahpeh a lenggam khat nei tundoh peh ding chu kicheh tah in nei musah tai.  
\v 26 O Pakai, nangma bou Pathen nahi. Chule hitobang thilpha tampi hi na lhachapa kei dingin kitepna nanei e.  
\v 27 Chule tunjong, na lhachapa insung phatthei naboh a hichu na lhachapa a dinga a-itih gei a nangma masanga um jing ding ahi. Ajeh chu O Pakai, nangma phatthei boh chu ipi hijongleh phatthei boh chang jing ding ahi!” ati.   
\c 18  
\s1 David Sepaite Galjona Ho  
\p
\v 1 Chule David in Philistine te ana kisatpin ana jouvin Gath khopi le avel a kho umho jong chu analo in ahi.  
\v 2 Chuin David in Moab mite chu ana kisatpin ana joukit in ama khutnoiya aum uvin don le kai jong David ana peuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 3 David in jong Euphrates luipang a kon thahat tah a ahung kontou lai uvin Zobah lengpa Hadadezer sepai te chu Hamath chan in anasat in ajouvin ahi.  
\v 4 Hiti chun David in kangtalai 1,000 ana manin, chule kangtalai tol'a pang mi 7,000 amanin, keng lamjot sepai 20,000 ahi. Aman kangtalai kaiya pang sakol jouse akeng atanpeh in kangtalai 100 kaikham bou akhen in ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Chule Aram mite Damascus khopi a kon'a Hadadezer lengpa kithopi dia hung kon ho chu David in mi 22,000 jen ana that in ahi.  
\v 6 Hichun David in Aram mite gam a Damascus khopi a chun sepai tampi atousah in, Aram mite chu David khutnoiya anaum uvin don le kai jong ana peuvin ahi. Hijeh chun Pakaijin David chu agalkon nalam jousea galjona apejing e.   
\p
\v 7 David in Hedadezer sepai lamkai ho kipoh sana lum ho jouse chu Jerusalem ah ahin polut in ahi.  
\v 8 Hadadezer khopi Tebah le Cun a chun David in sum-eng tampi ahin kilah in chule Solomon in hiche sum-eng ho chu kisilna twikong le sum-eng khompi le Pathen houna in'a manchah ding thil dang semnan aneijin ahi. \x + \xo 18:8 \xt 1 Lgt 7:40-47; 2 Thusimbu 4:11-18\x*   
\p
\v 9 Hamath lengpa Toi in Zobah lengpa Hadadezer sepai te jouse David in abonchan ajoutai tithu anajan,  
\v 10 hichun amapan achapa Joram chu David galjona kipapi dingin anasol in ahi. Ajeh chu Hadadezer hin Toi ana kisatpi jinglai ahi. Joram chun David chu thilpeh tampi sana, sum-eng le dangka ho anapen ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Leng David in hiche thilpeh hung jouse ahin sum-eng le sana namdang mite—Edom, Moab, Ammon, Philistia, le Amalek mite kom'a ahin lahdoh jouse chu abonchan Pakaiya dingin ana tohdoh in ahi.  
\v 12 Zeruiah chapa Abishai kitipa chun Chikhuh Phaicham a chun Edom mite mi 18,000 jen ana that in ahi. \x + \xo 18:12 \xt Labu 60\x*   
\p
\v 13 Chuin aman Edom gamsung a chun sepai atousah in chule Edom mite chu David khutnoiya anaum uve. Hiti chun David chu achena chan a Pakaijin galjona apejingin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Hijeh chun David chu Israel pumpia lengvai pon apangin ama natoh thilbol ho jouse chu ami Isareal te a dinga thilpha le adih jeng ahi e.  
\v 15 Zeruiah chapa Joab chu sepai lamkai in apange. Ahilud chapa Jehosaphet chu thuching le lekha sunin ana pang in ahi.  
\v 16 Ahitub chapa Zadok le Abiathar chapa Ahimelech chu thempun apang lhon'in ahi. Seraiah kitipa chu thutanna mun a lekha sunin apang e.  
\v 17 Jehoiada chapa Benaiah chu lengpa venga pangho chunga vaipon ana pang e. Chule David chapa te chu lengpa kinbolna a vaihom pipun ana pang uve.   
\c 19  
\s1 David In Ammon Mite Ajo  
\p
\v 1 Phat chomkhat jouva Ammon mite Lengpa Nahash ahung thi chun, achapa Hanun chu lengin ahung pang tai.  
\v 2 David in, “Keiman Hanun chunga hi kakitahna kapohdoh ding ahi, ajeh chu apa Nahash hi keima chunga akitah jingin ahi,” ati. Hiti chun David in Hanun pa thina jeh a lunghemna akon lungmon sahna dingin asottolle ho asol'in ahi.  
\p Ahivangin David sottolle ho Ammon gam alhun phat un,  
\v 3 Ammon mite lamkaipa chun Hanun kom'a chun, “Nangman hiche mipite hi napa jabolna jal'a hunga nagel mong ham? Ahipoi! David in amaho hi agam umdan ho vetoh le a chujou tengleh hung kon uva agamsung mite jouse hi nokhum ding lung agot joh ahi,” tin aseiye.  
\v 4 Chuin Hanun in David sottolle ho chu amanin asam'u avopeh un chule aponsil hou jong akongjang atobuh dung uva achetan peh in abon chauvin David henga anungsol tauve.   
\p
\v 5 David in amite chunga hitobang thilsoh umchan le asottolle ho jachatna ho thu ajah jeh chun Jericho khopi achun akhamul'u ahung khandoh kah uva thamden uva chujou teng hung kile dingin thu athot e.   
\p
\v 6 Ammon mite chun, David lungdouna athilbol u ahetdoh phat uchun Hanun le Ammon mite chun Zoab le Aramaacah chule Ram-naharaim gam a kon sakol touthem sepai le kangtalai tampi thalahna din dangka pounds 75,000 jen ana thot in ahi.  
\v 7 Chujongleh ama hon kangtalai 32,000 jong athalah uvin, Maacah le asepai te jong ana kithopi uve. Chule hiche sepai ho chu Medaba mun a Hanun in ama khopi tah a ana pansah sepaiho toh chun ana umkhom uvin ahi.  
\v 8 David in hichu ajah phat in Joab le asepai gal-hang ho chu ama kisatpi din anasol paijin ahi.  
\v 9 Hichun Ammon mite jong ahung kondoh un khopi kelkot phung'a chun galsat dingin ahung kigoldoh tauve, chule galsat dia hung kon lengho jong chun ama hina thei cheh in galsat dia kigotna panmun akisem uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Joab in amelma ten anung ama a ahin nokhum amudoh phat in Israel te sepai hatlai ho chu Aram sepai te kisatpi dingin alhengdoh in ahi.  
\v 11 Chule aman sepai dang adalhah chengse chu asopipa Abishai lamkaina noiya Ammon mite kisatpi dingin apansah e.  
\v 12 Joab in asopipa jah a chun, “Aram mite chu kahin jolel le neihung kithopi ding chule nangin jong Ammon mite najolel le kahung kithopi ding nahi.  
\v 13 Hangsan'un! I-Pathen ule imite uva dinga gal isat diu ahi. Pakaijin ama deilam'in hinbol jeng tahen,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Joab le asepai ten Aram mite àsat un anadel jam tauve.  
\v 15 Chule Ammon miten Aram mite jam amudoh phat uchun Abishai a kon'in ana jam un akhopi uva ana kile tauve. Chuin Joab chu Jerusalem a akile tan ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Aram miten Israel te ajolel u ahetdoh phat uchun Euphrates luipang le avel dunga kon'in Aram sepai te akoukhom in amaho chu abon'un Hadadezer sepai jalamkaipa thunoiya ana umsah uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 17 David in hitobang thil umdan ho ahetdoh phat in Jordan Vadung vel dung jousea Israel sepai te chu galsat din ana koukhom in Aram mite toh ana kisat tauvin ahi.  
\v 18 Chule Aram mite chu Israel te a kon'in ana gallel un, ana jamkit tauvin ahi. Hichea chun David sepai ten Aram sepai lamkai pipu Shobach pum in sepai kangtalai tol mi 7,000 le kenglam sepai mi 40,000 jen ana that uvin ahi.  
\v 19 Hadadezer thunoi a leng umhon jong Israel ten gal ajo amudoh phat uvin, David angsunga akipelut uvin ama thunoiya aum tauve. Chujouvin, Aram miten a-itih a jong Ammon mite akithopi kit diu anom tapouve.   
\c 20  
\s1 David In Rabbah Ajo  
\p
\v 1 Chuche kum chavang lai a lengpa galbol dia ahung chun Israel mite chun Joab lamkaina noiya Ammon mite anasat uvin ahi. Hichun aman Rabbah khopi chu ana um khum'in ahi. Ahin, David chu Jerusalem'a chun ana umden'in ahi. \x + \xo 20:1 \xt 2 Samuel 11:1\x*   
\p
\v 2 Rabbah khopia David ahung lhunin lengpa lallukhuh chu aladoh in aman akikhuh in ahi. Hiche lallukhuh chu sanapah jem a kisem chule agih dan jong pound somsagi le nga ahi. David in jong thilman tampi khopia chun ahin kipoh in ahi.  
\v 3 Aman Rabbah kho mite chu soh in ana mangin, amaho chu thing-at, thih khenchi a leilai le heicha a thing chanin ana pansah in, Ammon mite chu engbolna ana pen ahi. Chujouvin David le asepai te chu Jerusalem a akile tauve.   
\s1 David In Philistine Chunga Galojana Anei  
\p
\v 4 Chujouvin, Israel te le Philistine te chu Gazer mun a gal in ana kisat kit un ahi. Hiche akisat nauva hin, Hushah kho a Sibbecai jin milen gal-hat minthang ho chilhah a kon Saph kitipa ana that in chule Philistine ten gal ana lel tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Philistine te toh gal kisatna mun khat ma ana umkit in, hichea chun Elhanan chapa Jair chun Gath khoa kon Goliath sopipa Lahmi chu ana that in ahi. Chule Lahmi tenglum chu lentah ahi. \x + \xo 20:5 \xt 1 Samuel 17:4-7\x*   
\p
\v 6 Philistine tetoh Gath khopia gal ana kisatna mun uva jong chun milentah gal-hatmi khutjung gup le kengjung gup nei abon'a somni le li nei khat ana pang e, ama hi gollui lai gal-hang minthang ho son chilhah a kon ahi.  
\v 7 Chule aman Israel mite totnopna le noise tah a anabol jeh chun David sopipa Shimea chapa Jonathan in ana that tai.   
\p
\v 8 David in anatha Philistine gal-hang mite hi Gath khoa kon milui gal-hang ho son chilhah jeng ana hiuve.   
\c 21  
\s1 David In Mijat Asim  
\p
\v 1 Israel douna din, Satan’in Israel chate mijat simdin David lengpa atildoh tai.  
\v 2 Hijeh hin David in Joab le a sepai lamkai ho jah ah, “Sahlam gamkai Beersheba apat lhumlam gamkai Dan chan gei Israel mijat gasim uvin lang, nasimdoh jat u chu kaheng’a hinchoi’un, keiman kahet nom’e,” ati.   
\p
\v 3 Ahin Joab in adonbut in, “Pakaijin Israel chate ajat ja’n hin punsah hen. Ahin ka pakai le ka lengpa, amaho khu namite hilou ham? Iding’a ka pakai pa’n hiche nabol nom ham? Iding’a Israel te chung’a themmona lhunsah ding nagot ham?” ati.   
\p
\v 4 Ahivang’in, lengpan athusei chu apetchah in, hijeh chun Joab jong lengpa thupeh nit in Israel chate chenna gam jousea mijat agasim in Jerusalem ahung kile tai.  
\v 5 Hichun asimdoh jat chu David heng’a ahetsah tai. Gal-hang chemjam lamthei cheh chu mi 1,100,000 alhingin, Judah mite jong 4,70,000 alhing uve.  
\v 6 Hiche jatsim ahin Joab in Levi mite le Benjamin mite vang asimtha pon ahi ajeh chu, lengpa thupeh chu Joab in ama boldia adeimo behseh jeng ahi.   
\s1 David Chonset Jeh A Thutanna  
\p
\v 7 Hichun, Pathen'in mijat sim kibol chu alunghanpi jeh in ami Israel te chu gotna achan tan ahi.  
\v 8 Chuphat in David in Pathen jah a hitin asei tai, “Vo Ka Pathen, keiman nangma doumah tah ka boldoh tai, ngol-hoitah hijongleh nei ngaidam kit in,” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Chuphat chun, Pathen'in David ding’a mitva neiya pangpa Gad heng’a hitin aseitai.  
\v 10 “David heng’a gache’n lang Pathen'in hitin aseiye tin gaseipeh tan, 'Gimbolna thum lah a hin khat kilhen inlang, hichu keiman ka guilhun sah tei ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Hijeh chun David heng’a Gad ahung’in hitin aseitai, “Pathen'in hicheng thum hi na gonpeh tai.  
\v 12 Kum thum sung’a kellhah ding nadei’am, nagal miten chemjam a lhathum sungsea nasuhgam ding nalhen ding ham ahiloule, nithum sunga gamna hise nasatah a lhung’a na lenggam sung pumpia Pakai vantil in namite asuhgam ding hoijoh nalhen ding ham? Eihin solpa Pathen heng’a iti kalhut ding kilhen'in,” ati.   
\p
\v 13 “Ka dinmun ahahsa valtai!” tin David in Gad jah a aseitai. “Iti nama jongleh mihem khut a kipeh sang’in Ka Pakai, Ka Pathen khut joh a kipelut tang’e. Ajeh chu, amihepina kidangtah chu kakinem nalaiye,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Hichun, Pathen'in Israel te lah a gamna hise alansah tan, mi 70,000 jen in thina atoh tai.  
\v 15 Chuban’a jong, Pathen'in Jerusalem sugamhel din mithat vantil ahinsol tan ahileh, akigot jinglai in, Pathen'in alung ahin heiyin, vantil jah a, “Aphaset tai! Ngatan!” tin aseitai. Chupet tah chun, mithat vantil chu Jerusalem chungvum’a ana pansa tan ahi. Hichu Jebus mipa Araunah changphol ahitai.   
\p
\v 16 David in vanlang a Pakai vantil ten chemjam pum a Jerusalem suhgam ding agot u amu phat in, Israel lamkai pipuho toh kisih pumin khaodip ponsil pum’in tollang angauvin ahi. .  
\v 17 Chuin, David in Pathen jah a aseitai, “Israel te mijat sim ding’a thupeh nei chu keima kahi, abolkhel le achonse chu keima kahi, kamite vang kelngoi bang’a themmona ipi aboldoh u hitam? O ka Pakai le ka Pathen’u, nalung hanna kei le ka insung mite chung’a chuhsah tan, namite vang sugam hih hel in,” ati.   
\s1 David In Maicham Asah  
\p
\v 18 Hichun, Pakai vantil’in Gad jah a David achetou a Jebus mipa Araunah changphol a maicham phung asah din thupeh aneitai.  
\v 19 Hijeh chun David in Gad thulhut bangin Pathen thupeh chu boldin achetou tai.  
\v 20 Araunah le achapa te mili chun suhlou chang ana den pettah un Vantil chu amu uvin ahileh, achapa te chu akichat jeh un ajam uvin akisel gam tauve.  
\v 21 Araunah in David chu changphol ahinphah amu phat in, atohban dalhan Lengpa chu ana bohkhup tai.   
\p
\v 22 David in Araunah jah a hitin aseitai, “Na Changphol mun hi aman lhingsel keiman nape’ng ting, Pakai maicham phungkhat satang’e, chuteng Pakai lung hanna hiche gimna hise jong thip tante,” ati.   
\p
\v 23 “Kilah inlang nadei bangtah in mangcha tan, chujongleh keiman pumgo thilto a manchah din bongchalte, maicham mei tina din changsuh thing chule, thilto din suhlou chang jong pehtha inge,” tin Araunah in David jah a aseitai.   
\p
\v 24 Ahivangin Leng David in Araunah adonbut in, “Keiman aman lhingset napeng ting, nangma thil vang maicham thilto din kilah tha pong’e,” ati.  
\v 25 Chuin, David in Araunah chu sana pheng 6000 chu changphol man dingin apetai.   
\p
\v 26 Hilai mun ahin David in maicham phung khat asan, pumgo thilto le kichamna maicham asemin, taona amang tan ahile, Pathen'in asanpeh hetna din van'a kon meikou ahin sol lhan pumgo thilto jouse akavamhel tai.  
\v 27 Hijeh chun Pathen'in chemjam ana lam’a kigo vantil chu achempai a anungkoi din thu apetai.   
\p
\v 28 Pathen'in amaicham sem asanpeh ahet phat in David in jong Araunah changphol mun achun kilhaina maicham asemtai.  
\v 29 Hiche phat laiya hi, Pakai Houbuh maicham le pumgo thilto maicham phung, Mose in gammang laiya anasem chu Gibeon mun a aumpet ahi.  
\v 30 Ahivangin David chun hiche laimun a chu Pathen lung gahol a gache ding chu agel le mithat vantil chemjam toh gotsadem a anaum jeh chun angapcha pon ahi.   
\c 22  
\p
\v 1 Chuin David in aseitai, “Hilai mun hi Pathen Hou-In mun chu hi ding ahitai, chule kilhaina, pumgo thiltona mun jong hi ding ahi!” ati.   
\s1 Hou-In Sahdohna Dinga Kigotna  
\p
\v 2 Hijeh chun David in gamsung a kholjin mijouse akoutup in, aboltheina cheh un Hou-In sahna ding song khengjol dingin apansah tai.  
\v 3 David in kelkot a man ding thingkil semna din thih tampi leh sum-eng tekhopset apen ahi.  
\v 4 Tyre le Sidon miten leng David ana peh Cedar thingtum ho jong chu tampi ana peh thai.   
\p
\v 5 David in aseijin, “Kachapa Solomon hi achapang nalaiyin, jilna le hetna jong neibeh nailou hijongleh, Pathen'in anganse a Hou-In sahdoh ding hi loupi ding, minthang ding chuleh leiset pumpia dia jong nasatah hi ding ahin, hijeh a chu tua hi kagonpeh pan ding ahitai,” ati. Hijeh a hi David in athi masanga Hou-In sahna dia thil le lo tampi akoitup ahitai.   
\p
\v 6 Hichun, David in achapa Solomon jah a Israel te Pathen chenna ding Hou-In theng asahdoh teina din athumop tai.  
\v 7 “Kachapa, keiman ka Pathen jabolna din a Hou-In theng khat kasadoh nom’e,” tin David in aseipeh e. \x + \xo 22:7 \xt 2 Samuel 7:1-16; 1 Thusimbu 17:1-14\x*  
\v 8 “Ahivangin Pathen'in kajah a aseiye, nangman na galbolna munna mi tampi nathat tai. Chuleh, keima mitmua thisan tampi naso tah jeh a, nangman keima jabolna dia ka Hou-In theng nasah theilou ding ahitai.  
\v 9 Ahivang’a, chamna sem chapa khat nahin ding ahi, aman lengvai apoh sungsea Israel gam leh akimvel a agal mite kisan geiya chamdel a kalhat sah ding ahi. Amin Solomon kiti ding chuleh ama leng vaipoh sung’a hi Israel cham kalensah ding ahi.  
\v 10 Ama hi ahi keima jabolna dia Hou-In theng sadoh ding chu. Kachapa deitah hintin, Keima apa kahi ding ahi. Chuleh keiman a itih a alenggam sung’a chamna le lungmon konna kapeh ding ahi.”   
\p
\v 11 “Kacha tuhin, Pakaijin nakithopi intin aman nangma chung chang thudol’a asei tobangin, nangman jong Pakai, Pathen Hou-In nahin sahdoh tei ding ahi.  
\v 12 Pakajin thil hetkhen themna le datkhenje dan napeh ding, Israel chunga vaihom a natun ding, ngansena nahin peh teng jongleh Pakai, na Pathen danthu nanit jingna dingin nabol peh tahen.  
\v 13 Israel te dinga Pakaijin Mose athupeh chonna dan ahin, chondan jouse chu nanit jing ding chule ching thei tah a na khantoupi thei ding ahi. Hijeh chun hat inlang, hang in, kicha hih hel in chule lungthoina jong nanei louding ahi!” \x + \xo 22:13 \xt Joshua 1:6-9\x*   
\p
\v 14 “Genthei hesohna tothon keiman Pakai Hou-In sahdohna dingin, sana tons 4,000 kakhol khom in ahi. Chule dangka tons 40,000 jong kakhol khom in, sum-eng le thih jong ajat a tekham valset kakhol khom e, ijeh-inem itileh atam in, in thil le lo jong kakhol khom sohkeijin, hiche ho jouse hi nangman nabolbe ding ahina laiye.  
\v 15 Nangman songkheng them leh thingthembol chule khutthepna chom-chom nei mi tamtah naneije.  
\v 16 Sana lha-them, dangka kheng them, sum-eng lha them, thih kheng them chule adang mitampi nakoi ding ahi. Tun kipat in na tong tan, Pakaijin napanpi jing tahen!” ati.   
\p
\v 17 Chuin David in Israel mite sunga lamkai chengse thupeh aneijin, achapa Solomon akithopi diuvin thu aseijin ahi.  
\v 18 “Pakai, na Pathen uvin nangho napanpi jingu hilou ham? Ama tah in najet le navei uva hungkon nagal miteu asuhthip a chamna naneiju hilou ham? Ajeh chu Pakai, ama tah in agamsunga cheng mite chu keima khut a apedoh in, hijeh chun agamsung jouse hi Pakai angsung leh amite masanga suhnem’a uma, mite noija kikunsah ahitai.  
\v 19 Tun nang hon na lungthim pumpiu Pakai, na Pathen'u hol tauvin. Kipat un Pakai, Pathen muntheng Hou-In satauvin; chutileh Pakai Kitepna Thingkong le Pathen Hou-In a manchah um le bel chule thilkeo atheng jouse hiche Pakai dinga Hou-In kisadoh sunga chu pohlut a um ding ahitai,” ati.   
\c 23  
\s1 Levi Mite Mopohna Ho  
\p
\v 1 Chuin David ahung teh in, akum atamphat in achapa Solomon chu Isreal te lengpan apansah tai. \x + \xo 23:1 \xt 1 Lgt 1:1-40\x*  
\v 2 Aman Isreal gam a lengte, thempuho chule Levi mite akhom in ahi.  
\v 3 Levi te chu kum somthum apat chunglam se chu khat-khat in akisim'un, pasal mi 38,000 alhing ui.  
\v 4 David in aseijin, “Levite jouse lah a mi 24,000 chu Pathen Hou-In sunga na atoh diu ahi. Adang mi 6,000 chu alamkai le thutan vaihom a pang diu ahi.  
\v 5 Adang mi 4,000 chu kotngah a pang diu, mi 4,000 ma chu keiman kapeh tumging ho mangcha a Pathen avahchoi jing dingu ahi,” ati.  
\v 6 Chuin David chun Levi mite chu amaho phung khailhah dungjuijin thum'in —Gershon, Kohath le Merari in ahom khenin ahi.   
\s1 Gershon Chilhah  
\li1
\v 7 Gershon mite ho chu Lipni le Shimei ahi.  
\v 8 Lipni chate chu Jehiel le Zatham le Joel agom a thum  
\v 9 Shimei chate chu Shelomith leh Heziel le Haran ahi. Amaho hi Lipni insunga mi upaho ahiuve  
\v 10 Chule Shimei chate chu Jahath, Ziza, Zeush chule Beriah. Amaho li hi Shimei chate ahiuve.  
\v 11 Chule Jahath chu Haosa lamkai ana hin, Zizah chu ani channa anahi, amavang Jeush chule Beriah teni hin chapa tampi ana hing lhon lou jeh in pakhat insung in akisim tai.   
\s1 Kohath Chilhah  
\li1
\v 12 Kohath chilhah ho chu Amram, Izahar, Hebron chule Uzziel ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 13 Amram cha pasal teni chu Aaron chule Mose ahi. Aaron hin Pathen a dingin pumgo thilto ana lhantheng jing theina dia chule ama achapa ten atonsot a Pathen anga thilto gimnamtui ana hal jing uva; ama lenggam a dinga akipehdoh jing uva, chule ama minna phatthei achan jing theina diuvin, asopipa toh ana kisukhen in ahi. \x + \xo 23:13 \xt Potdohbu 28:1\x*   
\pm
\v 14 Mose hi Pathen mipan ana kisimin ahi. Achapa te chu Levi chilhah noiya ana kiminvon ahi.  
\v 15 Mose chapa te chu Gershom chule Eliezer ahi lhone.  
\v 16 Gershom chapa telah a chun Shebuel chu insung lamkai ahi.  
\v 17 Eliezer hin chapa khatbou ahingin, Rehabiah, insung lamkai ahi. Rehabiah hin chilhah tampi ana neijiin ahi.   
\li1
\v 18 Izhar chapa te lah a Shelomith chu ana insung lamkai ahi.   
\li1
\v 19 Hebron chapa te lah a Jeriah (insung lamkai), Amariah (anina), Jahaziel (athumna), chule Jekameam (alina) ahi.   
\li1
\v 20 Uzziel chapa te lah a Micah chu (insung lamkai) ahin chule Isshiah (ani channa) ahi.   
\s1 Merari Chilhah  
\li1
\v 21 Merari chilhah ho chu Mahli le Mushi ahi.  
\li1 Mahli chapa te chu Eleazer le Kish ahi lhone.  
\v 22 Eleazar chu chapa nei louvin athin, chanu bou aneijin ahi. Asopi Kish chapa ten achanu te akichen pin ahi.   
\li1
\v 23 Mushi chapa thum ho chu Mahli, Eder chule Jerimoth ahiuve.   
\b  
\p
\v 24 Hichengse hi Levi insungmi le ason apah ho chengse ahiuve, insung dungjuiya lamkai hon jong, amin cheh uva chingthei tah a kijihlut ahiuve. Amaho ho hi kum somni ahilouleh achunglam ho chu Pakai ina natong thei dia lhing cheh ahiuve.  
\v 25 Hijeh chun David in, “Pakai, Isreal Pathen, chun amite chamna apen, chule Jerusalem a cheng jing ding ahi.  
\v 26 Tun Pathen Houbuh a kimang le athil ho chengse jong Levi ten apohlele lou diu ahitai,” ati. \x + \xo 23:26 \xt Danbu Ni Na 10:8\x*  
\v 27 David hilchahna achaina pen dungjuijin, Levi te chu kum somni a tah le achunglam apat kisim pan ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Levi te chun Pathen Houbuh a Aaron chapa te akithopiuva, indan ho sutheng le ding, thil thengho koitup ding chule Pathen Houbuh a natoh chengse vetup ding ahiuve. \x + \xo 23:28 \xt Minbu 3:5-9\x*  
\v 29 Dokhanga changlhah luidoh ding, todoh ding changbong ho chule ajat alet aneo dungjuiya haltoh ding chengse jong avettup diu ahi.  
\v 30 Jingkah seh leh ding uva Pathen avahchoi dingu ahi. Nilhah le angaima banga abol kit diu ahi.  
\v 31 Chule ama hon Sabbath nikho le Lhathah nikho a Pakai anga thilto abol teng ule amijat ana ngaichat dungjui a abol diu ahi.   
\p
\v 32 Hiti chun Levi ten ponbuh a kinbol hihen muntheng kibol hihen, asopiu Aaron chapa te chu Pakai kin bolna a akithopi jing diu ahi.   
\c 24  
\s1 Thempu Hon Atohdiu Ho  
\p
\v 1 Aaron chilhah, thempuho, ahon dungjuijin natoh akihom khen uve. Aaron chapa te chu Nadab, Abihu, Eleazer leh Ethamar ahiuve.  
\v 2 Nadab le Abihu hi apa sang'in athimasa lhon'in, chapa jong anei lhon tapoi. Eleazer leh Ithamar chun thempu natoh ahin tongpeh lhon e. \x + \xo 24:2 \xt Thempu Dan 10:1,2\x*   
\p
\v 3 Eleazar chapa te lah a Zadok le Ithamar chapa te lah a Ahimelech panpina jal’in David chun ama-ama natoh ding toh kisaijin agoltoh sohkeiyun ahi.  
\v 4 Ithamar chapa te sang'in, Eleazar chapa te sunga chun mi upa atam un, hijeh chun Eleazar chapa te lah a chun apu apateu insung lhahdol cheh in, lamkai som le gup alhengdoh un, amaho lamkai nan aum un ahi. Chule Ithamar chapate dingin lamkai miget bou ana lhengdoh un ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Akilhengdoh le lamkaija kipansah ho hi kibang chetna vang kisansah ahiuvin, hitia akibolnaa kon chun Eleazar leh Ithamar chapa te lah a kon'in, muntheng a natong vaihom ding leh Pathen natohna vaibol ding tampi kisepdoh ahi.  
\v 6 Nethanel kiti Levi mi Shemiah hi danthu them ahin, amaho chengse chu lengpa le milen milalte angsung, Zadok thempupa angsung le Abiathar chapa Ahimelech angsung le thempu ho chule Levi miho, apu apa teuva pat phung upa chengse lekha in ajihlut tan ahi; ajeh chu pa khang khat lhahse chu Eleazar insunga kon kilhengdoh ahin, chule pa khang khat lhah chengse ma chu Ithamar insunga dia kilhengdoh ahi.   
\b  
\li1
\v 7 Vang kisan masapen chu Jehoiarib chunga achun ahi.  
\li1 Anina chu Jedaiah chunga achun ahi.   
\li1
\v 8 Thumna chu Harim chunga achun ahi.  
\li1 Lina chu Seorim chunga achun ahi.   
\li1
\v 9 Ngana chu Malkijah chunga achun ahi.  
\li1 Gupna chu Mijamin chunga achun ahi.   
\li1
\v 10 Sagina chu Hakkoz chunga achun ahi.  
\li1 Gietna chu Abijah chunga achun ahi.   
\li1
\v 11 Kona chu Jeshua chunga achun ahi.  
\li1 Somna chu Shecaniah chunga achun ahi.   
\li1
\v 12 Som le khatna chu Eliashib chunga achun ahi.  
\li1 Som le nina chu Jakim chunga achun ahi.   
\li1
\v 13 Som le thumna chu Huppah chunga achun ahi.  
\li1 Som le lina chu Jeshebeab chunga achun ahi.,   
\li1
\v 14 Som le ngana chu Bilgah chunga achun ahi.  
\li1 Som le gupna chu Immer chunga achun ahi.   
\li1
\v 15 Som le sagina chu Hezir chunga achun ahi.  
\li1 Som le gietna chu Happizzez chunga achun ahi.   
\li1
\v 16 Som le kona chu Pethahiah chunga achun ahi.  
\li1 Somni na chu Jehezkel chunga achun ahi.   
\li1
\v 17 Somni le khatna chu Jakin chunga achun ahi.  
\li1 Somni le nina chu Gamul chunga achun ahi.   
\li1
\v 18 Somni le thumna chu Delaiah chunga achun ahi.  
\li1 Somni le lina chu Maaziah chunga achun ahi.   
\b  
\p
\v 19 Amaho chengse hi akipansahna cheh uvin, natoh ding anei cheh un, Pathen Hou-In sung ahung lut phat uleh, Pakai, Israel Pathen'in apupau Aaron thu anapeh bang leh, Aaron in amaho chengse toh ding agontoh bangin atoh diuva kilom cheng chu atong jiuvin ahi.   
\s1 Levi Mite Insung Lamkaiho  
\m
\v 20 Hiche ho hi Levi insung khailhah a insung lamkai ho chu ahiuve:  
\b  
\li1 Amram chilhah a kon, alamkai chu Shubael ahi.  
\li1 Shubael chilhah a kon, alamkai chu Jehdeiah ahi.   
\li1
\v 21 Rehabiah chilhah a kon, alamkai chu Isshiah ahi.   
\li1
\v 22 Izhar chilhah a kon, alamkai chu Shelomith ahi.  
\li1 Shelomith chilhah a kon, alamkai chu Jahath ahi.   
\li1
\v 23 Hebron chilhah a kon, Jeriah chu alamkai ahin, ani channa pa chu Amariah ahin, athum channa pa chu Jahaziel ahin, ali channa pa chu Jekameam ahi.   
\li1
\v 24 Uzziel chilhah a kon, alamkai chu Micah ahi.  
\li1 Micah chilhah a kon, alamkai chu Shamir ahin.  
\v 25 Micah sopipa chu Isshiah ahi.  
\li1 Isshiah chilhah a kon, alamkai chu Zechariah ahi.  
\v   
\li1
\v 26 Merari chilhah a kon, alamkai chu Mahli le Mushi ahilhon e.  
\li1 Jaaziah chilhah a kon, alamkai chu Beno ahi.  
\v   
\li1
\v 27 Merari chilhah chu Jaaziah chan a alamkai ho chu Beno, Shoham, Zaccur le Ibri ahiuve.  
\v   
\li1
\v 28 Mahil chilhah a kon, alamkai chu Eleazar ahin, amapa hin chapa ana hing tapoi.  
\v   
\li1
\v 29 Kish chilhah a kon, alamkai chu Jerahmeel ahi.   
\li1
\v 30 Mushi chilhah a kon, alamkai chu Mahli, Eder chule Jerimoth ahiuve.  
\b  
\p Amaho chengse hi Levi mitea kon chapa, apu apateu lhah’a ama insung cheh’a kon kisimdoh ahiuve.  
\v 31 Aaron chilhah bangin, akum ahilouleh apanmun dungjuiyun vang asangun toh ding akipeuvin ahi. Vang sanna hi Lengpa David, Zadok, Ahimelech, chule thempu ho le Levi te insung lamkai ho umna a kibol ahi.   
\c 25  
\s1 Tumging Themho Mopohna  
\p
\v 1 David le a sepai jalamkai ten Asaph, Heman chule Jeduthun insungmi chu Kipana Thupha sapphong toh thoa semjang gin ngai, tumging chule khutbeh la lamkai din alhengdoh tauve. Hiche hi amin ule anatoh u ahi:   
\b  
\li1
\v 2 Asaph chapa te Zaccur, Joseph, Nethaniah chule Asarelah ahiuve. Amahon apau, Asaph, lamhilna dungjuiya na atoh u ahin, leng thusah dungjuiya Pathen thu seiphongna chu amaho kin ahi.   
\li1
\v 3 Jeduthun chapa te Gedaliah, Zeri, Jeshaiah, Shimei, Hashabiah chule Mattithah, abonun mi gup ahiuve. Amaho hin apau Jeduthun makainan semjang gin ngei, thangvah le vahchoi toh thon Pathen thu sapphongna aneiyun ahi.   
\li1
\v 4 Heman chapa te chu Bukkiah, Mattaniah, Uzziel, Shubael,\f * \fr 25:4 \ft Hebrew \fqa Shebuel, \ft a variant spelling of Shubael; compare 25:20.\f* Jerimoth, Hananiah, Hanani, Eliathah, Giddalti, Romamti-ezer, Joshbekashah, Mallothi, Hothir chule Mahazioth ahiuve.  
\v 5 Hiche ho jouse hi Hemam chapa te ahiuvin, lengpa mitva neiya pang Heman hin Pakaiya kon'in chapa som le li toh chanu thum ahing e.   
\b  
\p
\v 6 Hiche miho jouse hin apauvin alamhil dungjui uva tumging thei ho Pakai insunga asem'u ahi. Amopoh nau hi Pathen ina tumging thei, selangdah gin ngei, semjang sai chule khutbeh ho ajaovin ahi. Chule ijakaiyin, Asaph, Jeduthun chule Heman jong lengpa toh aki thukop jing uve.  
\v 7 Amaho insung hi Pakai vahchoi na mun a tumging sai ding mong a hung kitillu ahi. Abonchauvin tumging sai thei cheh mi 288 alhing uve.  
\v 8 Mi hichengse hi teh le khang hihen jilkung le simlai umlouvin athepna cheh uva apang un chuleh vang kibangin akisan cheh uve.   
\b  
\li1
\v 9 Vang kisan masapen chu Asaph phung'a Joseph le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.  
\li1 Vang kisan anina chu Gedaliah le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 10 Vang kisan athumna chu Zaccur le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 11 Vang kisan alina chu Zeri le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 12 Vang kisan angana chu Nethaniah le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 13 Vang kisan agupna chu Bukkiah le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 14 Vang kisan asagena chu Asarelah le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 15 Vang kisan agietna chu Jeshaiah le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 16 Vang kisan akona chu Mattaniah le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 17 Vang kisan asomna chu Shimei le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 18 Vang kisan som le khatna chu Uzziel le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 19 Vang kisan som le nina chu Hashabiah le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 20 Vang kisan som le thumna chu Shubael le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 21 Vang kisan som le lina chu Mattithiah le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 22 Vang kisan som le ngana chu Jerimoth le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 23 Vang kisan som le gupna chu Hananiah le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 24 Vang kisan som le sagena chu Joshbekashah le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 25 Vang kisan som le gietna chu Hanani le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 26 Vang kisan som le kona chu Mallothi le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 27 Vang kisan somni na chu Eliathah le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 28 Vang kisan somni le khatna chu Hothir le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 29 Vang kisan somni le nina chu Giddalti le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 30 Vang kisan somni le thumna chu Mahazioth le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\li1
\v 31 Vang kisan somni le lina chu Romanti-ezer le achapa te chule akinaipi som le ni ho chunga achu'n ahi.   
\c 26  
\s1 Kelkot Ngah Ho Mopohna  
\p
\v 1 Kelkotbul ngah ho kivaihop dan chu hiti ahi:  
\b  
\li1 Korah chilhah a konna Kore chapa Meshelemiah kitipa hi Abiasaph insung a kon ahi.  
\v 2 Meshelemiah chapa te chu Zechariah (atahpen), Jediael (a nina), Zebadiah (a thumna), Jathniel (a lina),  
\v 3 Elam (a ngana), Jehohanan (a gupna) chuleh Eliehoenai (a sagena) ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 4 Kelkot ngahpa Obed-edom chapa te chu Shemaiah (atahpen), Jehozabad (a nina), Joah (a thumna), Sacar (a lina), Nethaniel (a ngana),  
\v 5 Ammiel (a gupna), Issachar (a sagena), chule Peullethai (a gietna) ahiuve. Pathen'in Obed-edom chu nasatah in phatthei aboh in ahi.   
\pm
\v 6 Obed-edom chapa Shemaiah chun chapa mibolthei cheh ahing’in a phungsung u vaihomna a panmun nasatah alo cheh uve.  
\v 7 Amaho chengse chu, Othni, Rephael, Obed chule Elzabad ahiuve. Chuban le, asopi teniu Elihu le Semakiah jong chu mibolthei tah ma ahi lhon e.   
\pm
\v 8 Obed-edom chilhah, achapa te le a tute mi somgup le ni chengse hi natohna a feltah le bolthei cheh ahiuve.   
\li1
\v 9 Meshelemiah chapa te mi som le giet le asopite chengse hi mibolthei tah ahi cheh uve.   
\b  
\li1
\v 10 Merari phung sunga kon'in Hosah chun Shimri chu achapa te lah a atahpen ahilou vangin lamkai din alhengdoh tai.  
\v 11 Achapa te chu Hilkiah (a nina), Tebaliah (a thumna), chule Zechariah (a lina) ahiuve. Hosah chapa te le asopite mi som le thum chengse chu kelkot ngah in apang uve.   
\b  
\p
\v 12 Hitobanga kelkot ngah ho kivaihop dan hi Levi dang ho banga a insungmi cheh in Pakai na chu atoh u ahi.  
\v 13 Kelkot ngah dia kelkot tin a insung miten ahin deilhen hi kum le lha hihen, thep le theplou man a kive hilouvin vang kisan dungjuiya pangji ahiuve.   
\p
\v 14 Solam kelkot ngah a pang din Meshelemiah le aloite nganse ahitauvin, sahlam chu michingtah a kihepa Zechariah,  
\v 15 Lhanglam kelkot chu Obed-edom nganse ahin, achapa te chu thil kholna kelkot ngah in apang uve.  
\v 16 Shuppim le Hosah chu lhumlam kelkot apat Hou-In jottouna kelkot chan angah a ngense ahi lhonin ahi. Angapi ho chu akimaingat sah in limgeh in apang uve.  
\v 17 Solam kelkot phunga chun niseh in migup, sahlam a mili, lhanglam a mili ma chuleh mili kingato cheh in thil kholna kelkot phunga apang jing’ui.  
\v 18 Lhumlam kelkot phunga mi gup chuleh mili chu kotpi a kon a Hou-In jottouna chan'a apangun, mini ma avellah achun apang’e.   
\p
\v 19 Korah le Merari phungsung a kelkot ngah ho kivaihop dan hiti chu ahi.   
\s1 Gouching Leh Migun Ho  
\p
\v 20 Levite lah a Ahijah lamkainan maicham thil kholna mun le Hou-In gou ho kholna mun avetup uve.  
\v 21 Gershon phungkhai, Libni insung’a kon'in Jehiel chu lamkai khat in apang’e.  
\v 22 Jehiel, Zetham chule Joel chapa te jong Pathen maicham thil kholna mun chu ngah din ngansena achang tauve.   
\p
\v 23 Hiche lamkai a pang cheng hi Amram, Izhar, Hebron chuleh Uzziel chilhah ahiuve.   
\b  
\li1
\v 24 Amram phung sunga dia, Shebuel chu Mose chapa, Gershom chilhah ahi. Ama hi thil kholna a vaibol pipu Ahi.  
\v 25 Asopite Eliezer in ahin ho chu, Rehabiah, Jeshaiah, Joram, Zicri chule Shelomoth ahiuve.   
\pm
\v 26 Shelomoth le asopite hi Leng David, insung lamkai pipu, sepai jalamkai chuleh mi thupi hon Pakaiya dia maicham thilto a ahin peh hou anga u ahi.  
\v 27 Galmun a kon a kichomkhom thil hoi lai-lai ho jong Pakai Hou-In sunga manchah le din ahin lhandoh jiuve.  
\v 28 Chujongleh, Shelomoth le asopi ten Themgao Samuel, kish chapa Saul, Ner chapa Abner le Zeruiah chapa Joab thilto ho jong achingtup jing uve.   
\li1
\v 29 Izhar phung a kon'in Kenaniah ahung pengdoh in ahi. Ama le a chapa te toh Israel sunga vaibol le thutan in apang uve.   
\li1
\v 30 Hebron phunga kon'in Hashabiah ahung pengdoh in ahi. Ama le asopite thil bolthei cheh 1,700 toh Jordan vadunga patna lhumlam a um Israel te gambeh sunga, Pathen thulam hihen lang Lenggam thu hijongleh ngansena lentah achang tauve.   
\pm
\v 31 Chujongleh, Hebron phung a kon'in Jeriah ahung pengdoh in, ama hi Hebron mite phunggui kisut dan a lamkai le khat anahi. (David lengpa kum somli alhin a akholdoh dungjui uva, Hebron te lah a mibolthei tampi Gilead gam Jazer khopi a amudoh u ahi.)  
\v 32 Mibolthei tah miho chu mi 2,700 chengse chu Jeriah sopite ngen jeng ahiuve. Amaho hi Leng David in Jordan Vadung apat a solam a asol a Reuben leh Gad chule Mannaseh chilhah akehkhat langpi vekol dinga ijakaiya Pathen thulam hihen lengpa thu hijongleh ngansena lhingset chang ahiuve.   
\c 27  
\s1 Sepai Lamkaiho  
\p
\v 1 Israel sepai jalamkaite le avaibol teuvin lengpa hongbit dia asepai te ahon hon a akivaihop dan u chu hiti ahi. Sepai hon khat a mi 24,000 alhing uvin, kum khat le lhakhat cheh pan ala teiyun ahi.   
\b  
\li1
\v 2 Sepai hon mi 24,000 ho panmun la masapen alamkai chu Zabdiel chapa Jashobeam ahi,  
\v 3 Ama hi Perez insung a kon sepai vaihom ho jouse lah a jong thaneipen ahi.   
\li1
\v 4 Sepai hon mi 24,000 lha nina a lamkai chu Ahoah insungmi Dodai kitipa ahin, anoidou a thanei vaihom din Mikloth kitipa akikoi e.   
\li1
\v 5 Sepai hon mi 24,000 lha thumna a lamkai chu Jehoiada chapa Benaiah ahi.  
\v 6 Benaiah kitipa hi David sepai hangsan, mihat somthum ho lamkai a jong ana pang ahi. Achapa Ammizabad chu anoidou din apansah e.   
\li1
\v 7 Sepai hon mi 24,000 lha lina a lamkai chu Joab naopa Asahel ahi. Ama hi achapa Zebadiah in athi jouvin apanmun akhel tai.   
\li1
\v 8 Sepai hon mi 24,000 lha ngana a lamkai chu Shammah ahin, ama hi Izrah mi ahi.   
\li1
\v 9 Sepai hon mi 24,000 lha gupna a lamkai chu Tekoa akon Ikkesh chapa Ira ahi.   
\li1
\v 10 Sepai hon mi 24,000 lha sagena a lamkai chu Pelon akon Ephraim chilhah Helez ahi.   
\li1
\v 11 Sepai hon mi 24,000 lha gietna a lamkai chu Hushah a kon Zerah chilhah Sibbecai ahi.   
\li1
\v 12 Sepai hon mi 24,000 lha kona a lamkai chu Benjamin gamsung, Anathoth a kon Abiezer ahi.   
\li1
\v 13 Sepai hon mi 24,000 lha somna a lamkai chu Netophah a kon Zerah chilhah Maharai ahi.   
\li1
\v 14 Sepai hon mi 24,000 lhasom le khatna a lamkai chu Ephraim a Pirathon a kon Benaiah ahi.   
\li1
\v 15 Sepai hon mi 24,000 lhasom le nina a lamkai chu Netophah a kon Othniel chilhah Heled ahi.   
\s1 Israel Phung Lamkaiho  
\p
\v 16 Aban a ho hi Israel sunga phung ho le alamkai ho ahiuve:  
\b  
\tr
\th1 Phung 
\th2 Lamkai 
\tr
\tc1 Reuben 
\tc2 Zicri chapa Eliezer 
\tr
\tc1 Simeon 
\tc2 Maacah chapa Shephatiah 
\tr
\tc1   
\v 17 Levi 
\tc2 Kemuel chapa Hashabiah 
\tr
\tc1 Aaron (thempu te) 
\tc2 Zadok 
\tr
\tc1   
\v 18 Judah 
\tc2 Elihu (David sopipa) 
\tr
\tc1 Issachar 
\tc2 Michael chapa Omri 
\tr
\tc1   
\v 19 Zebulun 
\tc2 Obadiah chapa Ishmaiah 
\tr
\tc1 Naphtali 
\tc2 Azriel chapa Jeremoth 
\tr
\tc1   
\v 20 Ephraim 
\tc2 Azaziah chapa Hoshea 
\tr
\tc1 Manasseh (lhumlam) 
\tc2 Pedaiah chapa Joel 
\tr
\tc1   
\v 21 Manasseh (solam) Gilead 
\tc2 Zechariah chapa Iddo 
\tr
\tc1 Benjamin 
\tc2 Abner chapa Jaasiel 
\tr
\tc1   
\v 22 Dan 
\tc2 Jeroham chapa Azarel 
\b  
\m Hiche ho hi Israel sung'a phung lamkaiho ahiuve.   
\p
\v 23 Leng David in mijat sim abolna achun kum somni apat anoilam ho asimtha pon ahi. Ajeh chu, Pathen'in Israel chate chu van'a ahsi jat a phatthei aboh dia akitepna akoisa ahitai. \x + \xo 27:23 \xt Semtilbu 15:5; 22:17; 26:4\x*  
\v 24 Zeruiah chapa Joab chun mijat sim ijat a aboldoh kigot vang'in alosap jing’e. Ajeh chu Pathen lung hanna changa, Leng David khanga Israel mijat sim chu lolhing lou ahitai. \x + \xo 27:24 \xt 2 Samuel 24:15; 1 Thusimbu 21:1-14\x*   
\s1 David Lenggam'a Migun Ho  
\li1
\v 25 Adiel chapa Azmaveth chu lengpa thil kholna ngahtup din nganse ahi.  
\li1 Uzziah chapa Jonathan chu khopi thil kholna mun jouse ngahtup din nganse ahitai.   
\li1
\v 26 Kelub chapa Ezri chun lengpa loubol ho vetup din apangin ahi.   
\li1
\v 27 Ramah a kon Shimei chu lengpa lengpilei ngahtup in apang in ahi. Sepham a kon Zabdi chu lengpa ju le lengpitwi thah in apang’e.   
\li1
\v 28 Geder a kon a Baal-hanan chun Judah te moul bul a um lengpa Olive honsung chule theichang, theibalei chu angahtup in ahi. Lengpa heng’a Olive thao thah jing din Joash ngansena achang’e.   
\li1
\v 29 Sharon a kon Shitrai chu Sharon Phaicham lang’a gancha chunga mopo'n apange. Adlai chapa Shaphat chu phaicham lang’a gancha mopo'n apang e.   
\li1
\v 30 Ishamel chilhah Obil in sangongsao te amopoh e. Meronoth a kon Jehdeiah in Sangan ho amopoh in ahi.   
\li1
\v 31 Hagar mi Jaziz in lengpa kelngoi le kelcha amopoh e. Amaho chengse hi David Lengpa gou ching jeng ahiuve.   
\b  
\p
\v 32 David pangahpa, Jonathan chu michingtah le thil hethei tah chule lengpa semang khat ahi. Hachmon mi Jehiel chu lengpa chapate hilna lam amopoh in ahi.  
\v 33 Ahithophel kitipa hi Leng insung a thumop themtah ahin. Ark mi Hushai kitipa hi lengpa dia agol khat ahi.  
\v 34 Benaiah leh Abiathar chapa Jehoiada in Ahithophel athi jouvin a panmun ahin khel in ahi. Joab chu lengpa sepai jalamkai ahi.   
\c 28  
\s1 David In Solomon Athugah  
\p
\v 1 David in alenggam sung’a sepai jalamkai, vaipo le vaibol jouse, phung lamkai hihen gouching hihen, hetthei a panmun la jouse chuleh gal-hang jouse Jerusalem a akou sohkei un ahi.  
\v 2 Akipatdoh in hiti hin aseitai: “Ka sopi le ka mite ho, keiman Pathen Kitepna Thingkhong a itih a aum jingna ding, Pathen Hou-In theng sahdoh ding ka ngaiton, kigotnan thil le lo angaicha tampi jong kakoitai, \x + \xo 28:2 \xt 2 Samuel 7:1-16; 1 Thusimbu 17:1-14\x*  
\v 3 ahin Pathen’in kaheng’a aseijin, ‘Nangman kamin kijabolna dinga Hou-In nasah louding ahi, ajeh chu nangma gal-hang nahin chule thisan naso behseh e,’ ati.   
\p
\v 4 Hijeng jongleh, Israel Pathen'in Judah te lah a konna, ka insung uva pat keima tah a itih hijongleh Israel leng dia ei thaonu ahitai.  
\v 5 Chutah le, chapa tamtah phatthei eiboh ho lah a konna ka chapa Solomon in kaleng touna mun eikhel ding ahi.  
\v 6 Pathen'in kajah a aseiye, “Na chapa Solomon in ka Hou-In theng le akimvel asahdoh dia ka lhendoh ahitan, keiman angaichat ijakai kapeh jing ding ahi.  
\v 7 Chule ka thupeh chengse anit jing’a ahile, Keiman alenggam a itih a kaumpi jing ding ahi,' ati.   
\p
\v 8 “Hijeh chun tun, Pathen chu idiuva ahetoh, Israel mite jouse mitmua—Pakaiyah kikhom'un—Keiman hiche mopohna hi kapeh ding ahi. Chingtheiyun lang na Pakai na Pathen thupeh chengse nit jingun, chutileh lungmong a gampha lai nalo uva, na chateu le na tuteu khang geiya Pakai phattheina nachan jing diu ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 9 “Chujongleh, Solomon kachapa, napu le napa phattheiboh jing na Pathen chu haimil lou jen’in. Na lungthim pumpin choi’an jingin lang athun um jingin. Ajeh chu thil ijakai amun, ahe sohkeiyin, bel jing lechun na lhaso louding ahi.  
\v 10 Hijeh chun, nalunggil in ngaiton Pakaijin a Hou-In theng sa dia nalhendoh ahitai.. Hat jingin lang natohdoh tei ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Chuin, David in athilgon ijakai, thil kholna indan ho chule chonset kingaidamna munho umdol jouse Solomon apetan ahi.  
\v 12 David in alunggil a agontohsa, Hou-In lim asung apo, indan dang-dang chule Maicham kibolna Muntheng dia agon ho jouse achapa Solomon aseipeh tai.  
\v 13 Chujongleh, Hou-In sunga themgao ho leh Levi mite panmun hihen, Pathen houna dia thil le lo kimang ding jouse jong ahiltan ahi.   
\p
\v 14 David in Pathen houna a sana le sum-eng man dia lom jat jong ahiltoh in,  
\v 15 Solomon jah a Sana thaomei semna ding le sum-eng thaomei semna ding chuleh sana le sum-eng alut ding jat jong ahilthem in ahi.  
\v 16 Changlhah hung kitohdoh ho koina ding Sana theng a kisem Dokhang chule, sum-eng a kisem dokhang ho jong akisemna a sana angaicha ding jat jong ahilthem e.   
\p
\v 17 Thihkhe sana thengsel ijat asem a, khon, kong, silkong ho jouse sana ijat cheh a sem ding abonchan atetoh peh e.  
\v 18 Chujongleh, gimnamtui halna ding maicham phung semna dia sana thengsel man ding jat, chule kangtalai sunga Cherubium vantil in a lhaving teni a akhu khum, Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong sem ding dan jong ahiltan ahi.  
\v 19 “Thilgon hichengse hi”, tin David in Solomon jah a, “Pathen'in akhut tah a asut a eipeh ahi” ati.   
\p
\v 20 David in abanjom in, “Hat inlang hang jingin, natohdoh ding ahi. Kichat le lunglhah daina neihih hel in. Pakai Pathen, ka Pathen'in na umpi jing’e. Na ngansena bang’a nachai theng tokah a Pakaijin na lhonpi jing ding ahi.  
\v 21 Themgao ho le Levi miten akingansena banga Pakai kin abol diu, adangse injong akipeh nathei chan uva pan alah uva, gamsung vaipo ho jouse le thuneina aboncha a nangma thunoi a um ding ahi,” ati.   
\c 29  
\s1 Hou-In Sahna Dinga Thilpeh  
\p
\v 1 Hichun, Leng David in Hou-In sung’a mipi ho lam chu angan hitin aseiye, “Ka chapa Solomon, Pathen'in ka lengmun khel dia athaonusa chu ahin, ama chapang nalai intin, jilna neibeh nailou hijongleh, atoh dia lom Pathen'in angansena, a Hou-In sah ding khu mihem mai maiyin ajo chi vang ahipoi. \x + \xo 29:1 \xt 1 Thusimbu 22:5\x*  
\v 2 Manchah thei chan mangchan keiman ka Pathen Hou-In sahna din sana, songmantam, thing le song ijakai angaicha jouse kakoitup peh tai. Hiho chu alhingset adia, sana, sum-eng, thih, thing chujongleh, Onyx tampi seh hilouvin, songmantam, songval, songpol, marble song jong alhingset din kakoitup peh tai.   
\p
\v 3 “Tunjong, keiman ka Pakaiya dia kakipehdoh nan ka sana le sum-eng jouse jong a Hou-In sahna dia kagotpeh ho ban’in kapedoh tai.  
\v 4 Keiman Hou-In bang dung ho sahna din, Ophir a kon sana tons 112, chule dandka thengsel tons 262 jong kapedoh tai.  
\v 5 Chuban a, khutthem ho tham ding sana le sum-eng avat ding chengse ho hi, koi tobang ka Pakai ka Pathen adia keijong kakipedoh nom’e ti ium uvem?” ati.   
\p
\v 6 Hichun, insung lamkaiho, Israel phung lamkai ho ahin, sepai jalamkaiho, gouching ho chuleh, lengpa vaibol ho jouse jong kiphaltheng tah in akipedoh soh tauve.  
\v 7 Pathen Hou-In theng sahna dia akipehdoh nau abonchauva apehdoh jat uchu, sana tons 188, sana lheng 10,000, dangka tons 375, sum-eng tons 675, chule thih talent 3,750 alhing’e.  
\v 8 Chujongleh, songmantam tampi jong atodohbe uvin, athil todoh hou chu gou kholna Pakai in achun akholtup uvin Gershon chilhah a kon Jehiel in thil kholna mun avetsui din anganse uvin ahi. .  
\v 9 Maicham thiltho ho jouse mipi ten hongphal tah le kiphaltheng tah ato jeh uvin akipah cheh uvin ahi. Chujongleh Lengpa David jong kipah leh thanop nan adim’e.   
\s1 David Thangvah Taona  
\m
\v 10 Chuphat chun, Lengpa David in mipi jouse masang’a Pathen athangvah e.  
\b  
\pmo “Kahung kondohnao Vo ka Pathen’u, atonsot tonsot in nunnom in, namin kithangvah jinghen!  
\v 11 Nang'ah, Vo Pakai, minthanna jouse, loupina jouse, thaneina jouse, jabolna jouse, ijakai nang’a hijing hen. Leiset pumpi le vanthamjol abon'a nang’a ahin, Vo Pakai, thil ijakai nangma lenggam thaneina ahi. \x + \xo 29:11 \xt Matt 6:13\x*  
\v 12 Houna le jabolna nang’a kon bou ahi. Ajeh chu, imajouse nangma thunoiya umjeng ahi. Thaneina le loupina nangma khut a aum’in, nangma khut a minthanna le thaneina abonchan aum’e.   
\pm
\v 13 Vo ka Pathen’u, namin thangvah le choi-atna kahin peuve.  
\v 14 Ahinlah, keima koi kahiya, ka mite chu ipi hiuvam, nangma angsunga kipah le thanomtah a ipi hijongleh kapeh jeng thei uham? Kanei, kagou jouseu nangma a konna kamu jeng u ahin, kapeh hou jouse nangman neipeh ngen jengu ahi.  
\v 15 Chuleh, kapu kapateu bang’a, hiche leiset a hi khopem le maljin mai-mai kahiuvin, ka hinkhou jong nilim kihei bang’in ageina akihephaji tapoi.   
\pm
\v 16 “O Pakai ka Pathen’u, nangma jabolna, na Hou-In theng sahna dia kahin tokhom'u ijakai hi nang’a ahin, nangman neipeh jengu ahi.  
\v 17 Ka Pathen, nangman kalung’u na kholchil sohjin, nalung lhaina namudohji teng nakipahji e ti keima neihetsah in, chule lunggil tah a keiman thil hicheng kabol jong nahen ahi. Ka miten jong kipah le thanom tah a thilto, thilpeh nangma Hou-In theng sahdohna dia ahin choi ujong nei musah jing’e.   
\pm
\v 18 “O Pakai, kapu u Abraham Pathen, Isaac Pathen, Israel te Pathen, nami ten nathu angai jing ding uvin kahung taove. Nangma na jabol le nahepi nau jong mujing’in.  
\v 19 Ka chapa Solomon’in alungthim pumpia na thupeh chengse anit a, na danthu le na hettohsah hihen, ijakai ajui jing’a, keiman ka gontup pehsa na Hou-In theng kisahdoh kahsen lungvulna pejing'o,” ati.   
\b  
\p
\v 20 Chuphat in, David in mipi ho jah a, “Na Pakai, na Pathen’u thangvah un!” ati. Hichun, mipi jousen Pathen athangvah un, Apu apateu Pathen masang’a abohkhup un, chibai abol uvin, lengpa jong jabolna apeuvin ahi.   
\m
\v 21 Ajing nikhon, mipi ten Pakaiya kilhainan bongchal 1,000, Kelngoi 1,000 le kelngoichal 1,000 ahin choijun, pumgo thilton atoh uve. Chujongleh, Israel pumpi min’in lengpitwi le kilhaina tampi jong ahin choi uvin ahi.  
\v 22 An nehkhom abol’un, lengpitwi adon’un, kipah le thanom tah in Pathen athangvah uve.  
\p Chujongleh, Leng David chapa Solomon chu mipi ho masang’a leng hung chang din thao anu un, Zadok jong chu thempu din thaonuna achangtai.  
\v 23 Chuin, Solomon in apa Leng David laltouna mun chu ahin khel tan, imalam jousea apa athakhel jouvin, Israel pumpin jong ajabol sohkei tauve. \x + \xo 29:23 \xt 1 Lgt 2:12\x*  
\v 24 Mithupiho, gal-hang ho chuleh Leng David chapa te jousen jong Lengpa Solomon adin kitepna le kipehdohna anei tauve.  
\v 25 Chuban’a Pathen'in leng Solomon chu Israel pumpi masanga adomsang’in, a itih a Israel leng ten jong ana chan phahlou, minthanna, loupina le jabolna sangpenin Pathen'in phatthei abohtai.   
\s1 David Vaihom Sung Thulahgom  
\m
\v 26 Hitobanga hi, Jesse chapa David in Israel pumpi lengvai ana pon ahi.  
\v 27 Aeng vaipoh chu kum somli alhing’in, kum sagi sung Hebron chuleh, kum \x + \xo 29:27 \xt 2 Samuel 5:4,5; 1 Thusimbu 3:4\x* somthum le thum sung chu Jerusalem a lengvai anapo e.  
\v 28 Ahinkhon haona, jabolna achang’in, kum sottah hinkho kipah le thanom in amangin, atehset a ahinkho lhin mong’in athin, chuphat in achapa Solomon in a lengmun ahin khel e.   
\p
\v 29 Leng David vaipoh sungsea thil ijakai kijihlut ho jouse chu,\it Mitva Neipa Samuel Thusimbu, Nathan themgaopa Thusimbu le Mitva Neipa Gad Thusimbu \it* a akijihlut soh in ahi.  
\v 30 Hiche thilsoh ho jouse hin Leng David loupina aphochen uvin, chuleh aleng vaipoh sung’a Israel le akimvel lenggam hoa thilsoh jouse jong ajao cheh e.   